%0A%0ADespite%20choosing%20to%20share%20my%20house%20with%20one%2C%20I%20can%20sometimes%20see%20where%0AProf.%20Tolkien%20is%20coming%20from%20here:-%29%0A%0ABrenda%0A%0A--%0A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%0ABrenda%20Selwyn%0A%22In%20England%27s%20green%20and%20pleasant%20land%22%0AI%20may%20look%20in%20on%20this%20thread%20again%20before%20it%20is%20all%20over%2C%20but%20in%0Athe%20meanwhile%20I%20have%20some%20other%20pressing%20business%20to%20attend%20to.%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0AEen%20wilde%20Ier%20wrote:%0A%0A%0AThe%20idea%20is%20not%20to%20die%20for%20your%20country%20but%20to%20make%20the%20other%20bastard%0Adie%20for%20his%20---%20George%20Patton.%0A%0AAnyone%20who%20wants%20to%20close%20with%20the%20enemy%20when%20it%20is%20possible%20to%0A-obliterate-%20him%20at%20a%20safe%20distance%20is%20a%20coo%20coo%20nut.%20I%20would%20trade%20all%0Athe%20valor%20in%20the%20world%20for%20a%20working%20GPS%20system%20to%20guide%20in%20the%20JDAMS.%0A%0ABob%20Kolker%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0AEen%20wilde%20Ier%20wrote:%0A%0A%0AThere%20is%20Right%2FWrong%20and%20there%20is%20Power%2FNoPower.%20Guess%20which%20one%20matters%0Amore.%20I%20think%20Neitzche%20was%20onto%20something.%0A%0ABob%20Kolker%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0AI%20don%27t%20believe%20so%2C%20Tolkein%20appears%20to%20see%20no%20problem%20with%20the%0Acultural%20and%20maritime%20greatness%20of%20Numenor%2C%20the%20vast%20commercial%20and%0Aindustrial%20wealth%20of%20the%20Dwarves%20or%20the%20technical%20creativity%20of%20the%0ANoldor.%0A%0AMoreover%2C%20Tolkein%20stated%20that%20LOTR%20was%20not%20an%20allegory%2C%20when%20he%20was%0Aasked%20about%20its%20relationship%20to%20the%20narrative%20of%20the%20rise%20of%20thirties%0Afascism.%20%20To%20argue%20that%20the%20Marring%20of%20Arda%20corresponds%20directly%20with%0Aindustrialisation%20would%20involve%20reading%20his%20mythos%20as%20an%20allegory%20and%0Athus%20ignoring%20his%20distaste%20for%20that%20literary%20form.%0A%0AThat%20is%20not%20to%20say%20that%20Tolkein%27s%20myth%20may%20not%20be%20read%20as%20a%20critique%0Aof%20certain%20types%20of%20commercial%20or%20industrial%20activity.%20%20One%20of%20the%0Arecurring%20motifs%20in%20his%20stories%20are%20characters%20such%20as%20Melkor%2C%20Saruman%0Aand%20the%20Numenoreans%3B%20characters%20who%20begin%20with%20greater%20power%20and%0Acreativity%20than%20their%20peers.%20%20Having%20become%20enamoured%20with%20their%20own%0Aglory%20they%20succomb%20to%20the%20arrogance%20and%20the%20temptation%20to%20seek%20to%0Adominate%20those%20around%20them%20with%20the%20net%20effect%20that%20they%20squander%20the%0Avery%20power%20and%20creativity%20that%20made%20them%20great%20in%20the%20first%20place.%0AHence%2C%20although%20Tolkein%20had%20no%20real%20problem%20with%20commerce%2C%20wealth%20and%0Aindustry%2C%20he%20makes%20a%20distinction%20between%20the%20true%20creativity%20at%20the%0Aheart%20of%20%27free%27%20industry%20and%20%27free%27%20commerce%2C%20and%20the%20destructive%2C%0Aalbeit%20hugely%20powerful%2C%20mimickry%20at%20the%20heart%20of%20industry%20and%20commerce%0Adesigned%20to%20dominate.%0A%0A%0ACheers%0A%0AMike%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0AI%20was%20a%20lot%20more%20ecstatic%20than%20that%2C%20but%20then%20I%20hadn%27t%20read%20the%20books%0Afor%20some%20years:-%29%20%20I%27ve%20found%20re-reading%20them%20and%2C%20more%20especially%0Areading%20this%20ng%20has%20given%20me%20a%20rather%20more%20jaundiced%20view%20of%20the%20whole%0Aaffair%2C%20which%20is%20a%20shame%20in%20a%20way.%0A%0A%0AI%20was%20wondering%20about%20this%20the%20other%20day.%20%20Weren%27t%20some%20of%20them%20busy%0Adefending%20Lorien%20though%3F%0A%0A%0AThough%20preumably%20you%20realise%20PJ%20has%20taken%20liberties%20with%20that%20as%0Awell:-%29%20%20In%20the%20book%20by%20the%20time%20Frodo%20even%20meets%20Faramir%2C%20the%20sack%20of%0AIsengard%20is%20over%20and%20Aragorn%20is%20on%20the%20eve%20of%20taking%20the%20Paths%20of%20the%0ADead.%20%20This%20isn%27t%20a%20complaint%20-%20PJ%20was%20going%20to%20have%20to%20do%20something%0Alike%20this%20because%20books%20Three%20and%20Four%20end%208%20days%20apart%20%28this%20can%20be%20a%0Alittle%20confusing%20-%20because%20I%20used%20to%20have%20the%20edition%20without%20the%0Aappendices%2C%20I%20never%20had%20a%20clear%20idea%20of%20the%20timeline%20when%20I%20read%20it%0Aoriginally%29.%20%20So%20by%20the%20time%20the%20Ring%20party%20encounter%20Shelob%2C%20the%0Asiege%20of%20Gondor%20is%20already%20going%20on%21%20%20Although%20as%20I%27ve%20said%20he%27s%20taken%0Afurther%20liberties%2C%20by%20moving%20Shelob%20into%20RotK%20he%20has%20the%20possibility%0Aof%20getting%20things%20back%20on%20track.%0A%0AIMHO%20the%20best%20way%20of%20getting%20a%20clear%20idea%20of%20the%20timeline%20is%20to%20listen%0Ato%20the%20BBC%20Radio%20adaption%20in%20it%27s%20original%20form%2C%20where%20it%20was%0Abroadcast%20as%20a%20continuous%20narrative%2C%20keeping%20the%20timeline%20correct.%0AHowever%2C%20I%20don%27t%20know%20how%20it%27s%20been%20chopped%20up%20for%20the%20three%20separate%0ACDs.%0A%0A%0AAnd%20me%2C%20after%2020-odd%20years.%20%20I%20don%27t%20think%20that%27s%20a%20Bad%20Thing.%0A%0ABrenda%0A%0A--%0A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%0ABrenda%20Selwyn%0A%22In%20England%27s%20green%20and%20pleasant%20land%22%0AI%20may%20look%20in%20on%20this%20thread%20again%20before%20it%20is%20all%20over%2C%20but%20in%0Athe%20meanwhile%20I%20have%20some%20other%20pressing%20business%20to%20attend%20to.%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0AJens%20Kilian%20made%20dwagin-sized%20wripples%20in%20the%20Force:%0A%0AThat%27s%20what%20Morgoth%20wants%20you%20to%20think.%0A%0A%0AErmanna%20the%20Elven%20Jedi%20Knight%2C%20Lady%20of%20Imladris%2C%0AHeadmistress%20of%20the%20AFT%2FRABT%20Charm%20School%2C%0AHug-Therapist%2C%20Queen%20of%20the%20Balrog%20Wingophiles%2C%0AProtector%20of%20Kittens%20and%20Hamsters%2C%20Wielder%20of%20Tinw%EB%20and%20Smiter%2C%0AWarrior%20Princess%20of%20AFT%2FRABT%0A%0AYou%27ve%20read%20too%20much%20fantasy%20when%20you%20read%20%22spell-checker%22%0Aand%20you%20think%20of%20checking%20magic%20spells%20for%20flaws.%0A%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0AKarl-%20Peder%20Sj%F8m%E6ling%20made%20dwagin-sized%20wripples%20in%20the%20Force:%0A%0AYes.%0A%0A%0AErmanna%20the%20Elven%20Jedi%20Knight%2C%20Lady%20of%20Imladris%2C%0AHeadmistress%20of%20the%20AFT%2FRABT%20Charm%20School%2C%0AHug-Therapist%2C%20Queen%20of%20the%20Balrog%20Wingophiles%2C%0AProtector%20of%20Kittens%20and%20Hamsters%2C%20Wielder%20of%20Tinw%EB%20and%20Smiter%2C%0AWarrior%20Princess%20of%20AFT%2FRABT%0A%0AYou%27ve%20read%20too%20much%20fantasy%20when%20you%20read%20%22spell-checker%22%0Aand%20you%20think%20of%20checking%20magic%20spells%20for%20flaws.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0ANo%2C%20it%20seems%20to%20me%20Eowyn%20was%20romantically%20attracted%20to%20Aragorn%2C%20or%20at%0Aleast%20thought%20she%20was.%20%20I%20seem%20to%20recall%20someone%20here%20recently%0Adescribing%20her%20feelings%20as%20a%20%22crush%22%2C%20which%20seems%20about%20right%20-%20or%0Ainfatuation%20maybe.%20%20I%20think%20she%20was%20besotted%20by%20who%20Aragorn%20was%20and%0Awhat%20he%20stood%20for%20%28and%20I%20suspect%20he%20wasn%27t%20bad-looking%20either:-%29%2C%20and%0Amistook%20this%20for%20%22true%20love%22%20for%20the%20man%20himself%2C%20who%20in%20fact%20she%0Ahardly%20knew.%20%20Not%20an%20uncommon%20mistake%20-%20see%20for%20example%20any%20teenage%0Agirl%20with%20a%20wall%20full%20of%20Orlando%20Bloom%20posters:-%29%20%20%22I%20wished%20to%20be%0Aloved%20by%20another%22%2C%20she%20tells%20Faramir%2C%20which%20is%20pretty%20odd%20thing%20to%20say%0Aif%20she%20didn%27t%20feel%20a%20romantic%20attachment%20to%20Aragorn.%0A%0AAs%20to%20her%20motivation%20for%20%22dressing%20as%20a%20boy%20and%20playing%20soldier%22%2C%20I%27m%0Anot%20sure%20I%20would%20describe%20it%20in%20those%20terms%20anyway.%20%20Having%20read%20the%0Abook%20as%20a%20teenager%20many%20years%20ago%20I%20had%20this%20idea%20in%20my%20mind%20of%20Eowyn%0Ariding%20off%20valiantly%20to%20defend%20her%20people%2C%20but%20re-reading%20it%20recently%0AI%20find%20it%20wasn%27t%20like%20that%20at%20all.%20%20Her%20motivation%20was%20not%20courage%20but%0Adispair%3B%20her%20face%20was%20%22the%20face%20of%20one%20without%20hope%20who%20goes%20in%20search%0Aof%20death%22.%20%20Whether%20this%20was%20purely%20because%20Aragorn%20had%20spurned%20her%0A%28and%20as%20far%20as%20she%20was%20concerned%20had%20riden%20away%20to%20his%20death%29%2C%20or%0Abecause%20in%20so%20doing%20he%20had%20taken%20away%20the%20only%20chance%20she%20could%20see%20of%0Aescaping%20her%20situation%2C%20I%27m%20not%20sure.%20%20Bit%20of%20both%20maybe.%0A%0ABrenda%0A%0A--%0A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%0ABrenda%20Selwyn%0A%22In%20England%27s%20green%20and%20pleasant%20land%22%0AI%20may%20look%20in%20on%20this%20thread%20again%20before%20it%20is%20all%20over%2C%20but%20in%0Athe%20meanwhile%20I%20have%20some%20other%20pressing%20business%20to%20attend%20to.%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0AWhy%20do%20you%20bother%20knowing%20this%3F%20%20I%20thought%20it%20closed%20weeks%20ago%20%28in%20the%0AUK%20it%20probably%20did%29.%0A%0A%0AThe%20biggest%20surprise%20for%20me%20was%20that%20%20%22Finding%20Nemo%22%20has%20grossed%0Aanything%20at%20all%20as%20I%20didn%27t%20think%20it%20had%20opened%20yet.%20%20So%20I%20checked%0Aand%2C%20while%20it%27s%20been%20open%20in%20the%20USA%20for%20weeks%2C%20here%20in%20Europe%20we%20have%0Ato%20wait%20until%20the%20Autumn%20when%20all%20the%20kids%20have%20gone%20back%20to%20school.%0AGreat%20planning%20Disney%21%20%20What%27s%20the%20matter%20-%20couldn%27t%20they%20afford%20to%0Amake%20enough%20prints%3F%20%20Meanwhile%2C%20in%20December%20RotK%20will%20be%20released%20more%0Aor%20less%20simultaneously%20throughout%20the%20Western%20World.%0A%0ABrenda%0A%0A--%0A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%0ABrenda%20Selwyn%0A%22In%20England%27s%20green%20and%20pleasant%20land%22%0AI%20may%20look%20in%20on%20this%20thread%20again%20before%20it%20is%20all%20over%2C%20but%20in%0Athe%20meanwhile%20I%20have%20some%20other%20pressing%20business%20to%20attend%20to.%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0Acoyotes%20rand%20mair%20fheal%20greykitten%20tomys%20des%20anges%20wrote:%0A%0A%0AThe%20Hebrew%20Scriptures%20are%20common%20to%20all%20the%20Judeo-Christian%20sects.%20The%0Aangelology%20therein%20is%20sparse.%20Most%20angels%20%28malakhim%20or%20messengers%29%20are%0Aseen%20in%20visions%20or%20dreams%20e.g.%20jacob%20and%20the%20ladder%2C%20bilam%20the%20angel%20and%0Abilam%27s%20ass%2C%20and%20of%20course%20jacob%27s%20wrestling%20partner.%20Abraham%20and%20Lot%0Asaw%20their%20malakhim%20awake.%20In%20these%20cases%20the%20malakhim%20were%20just%0Amessenger%20boys%20and%20errand%20runners.%20They%20did%20not%20exhibit%20any%20initiative.%0A%0AThe%20seraphim%20mentioned%20in%20Isahiah%20are%20elements%20of%20a%20vision%20and%20not%0Aplayers.%20Even%20in%20the%20Passover%2C%20the%20death%20angel%20is%20carrying%20out%20an%0Aerrand%2C%20and%20not%20acting%20on%20his%20own%20initiative.%20He%20was%20programmed%20to%20look%0Afor%20houses%20without%20a%20blood%20mark%20on%20the%20lintel.%20If%20found%2C%20go%20in%2C%20slay%0Afirst%20born%20male%20if%20any.%20Very%20programatic.%0A%0AThere%20is%20nothing%20in%20the%20Hebrew%20scriptures%20that%20suggests%20a%20%22palace%0Arevolt%22%20lead%20by%20Uriel%20%28Lucifer%29.%20Even%20in%20the%20Book%20of%20Job%20the%20Satan%0A%28adversary%29%20does%20his%20task%20by%20giving%20poor%20Job%20a%20hard%20time.%20He%20does%20what%0Ahe%20was%20hired%20to%20do.%20Again%2C%20no%20free%20will%2C%20no%20initiative.%0A%0AOn%20the%20other%20hand%2C%20the%20very%20Evil%20Angel%20in%20Tolkien%20is%20none%20other%20than%0AMelkor%2FMorgoth.%20A%20case%20of%20ego%20run%20amok%2C%20and%20determined%20to%20rule%20or%20ruin%0AMiddle%20Earth.%20It%20is%20interesting%20to%20note%20that%20Eru%20does%20nothing%20to%20stop%0Ahim.%20Eru%20could%20have%2C%20but%20He%20does%20not.%20Eru%20has%20another%20agenda%20altogether.%0AMy%20conjecture%20is%20that%20Eru%20is%20doing%20creative%20destruction%2C%20with%20the%20end%0Abeing%20more%20perfect%20by%20virtue%20of%20all%20the%20destruction%20in%20the%20beginning.%0AGod%20works%20in%20mysterious%20ways%2C%20His%20wonders%20to%20perform.%0A%0AThe%20model%20of%20evil%20angel%20in%20LOTR%20and%20the%20Sil%20is%20closer%20to%20Christian%0Aangelology%20than%20that%20implied%20in%20the%20Hebrew%20scriptures.%20In%20the%20Sil%20Melkor%0Ais%20the%20numero%20uno%20Bad%20Guy.%20In%20LOTR%2C%20is%20is%20Melkor%27s%20flunky%20Sauron%20who%0Adoes%20the%20dishonors.%0A%0ABob%20Kolker%0A%0A%0A%0A
%0A%0Ateepee%20wrote:%0A%0A%0AWasn%27t%20Saruman%20an%20Istiri%20%28%20a%20wizard%29%3F%0A%0ABob%20Kolker%0A%0A%22Yer%20a%20Wizard%20Saruman%22%20---%20Hagrid.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
