%0A%22Gonzalo%20Diethelm%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%0Anews:3f2ec6ce$41nospam@nospam.net...%0A%0AYep.%20By%20the%20numbers...%0A%0A%231%20is%20the%20Platinum%20Series.%20It%20has%204%20discs%20in%20%5B%20%5B%20W%20I%20D%20E%20S%20C%20R%20E%20E%20N%20%5D%20%5D%0Aformat.%202%20of%20them%20are%20the%20movie%20and%20two%20with%20extra%20material.%0A%232%20%20is%20a%2016:9%20ratio%20with%20just%20the%20movie%20%28no%20extras%29%20in%20%5B%20%5B%20W%20I%20D%20E%20S%20C%20R%20E%20E%0AN%20%5D%20%5D%20format.%0A%233%20is%20a%204:3%20ratio%20that%20has%20the%20same%20material%20as%20%232%20with%20just%20the%20movie%20%28no%0Aextras%29%0A%234%20is%20the%20Gift%20set.%20It%20is%20the%20same%20as%20%231%20but%20it%20has%20an%20extra%20DVD%20%285%20DVD%27s%0Atotal%29%20with%20bonus%20material%20and%20a%20statue%20of%20the%20Argonath.%0A%0ASo%20to%20answer%20your%20question:%20What%20has%20the%20most%20material%2Feffects%20in%20Widescreen%0Aformat%3F%0A%0A%234%20has%20the%20most%20material%20and%20bonus%20footage%20in%20%5B%20%5B%20W%20I%20D%20E%20S%20C%20R%20E%20E%20N%20%5D%20%5D%0Aformat.%20So%20if%20you%20have%20the%20cash%20then%20thats%20the%20one%20you%20want%20to%20get.%20I%20have%0Athe%20regular%204%20disc%20Platinum%20series.%20However%20if%20your%20a%20collector%20the%205%20disc%0Agift%20set%20would%20be%20ideal.%20I%20wouldn%27t%20open%20it%20however.%20I%20would%20consider%20it%20a%0Acollectors%20edition%20and%20not%20gift.%20You%20never%20know%20when%20these%20things%20will%20stop%0Abeing%20produced.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
