%20Middle-earth.%0A%7C%20It%20will%20even%20give%20hints%20about%20which%20parts%20of%20those%20books%20you%27re%20likely%0A%7C%20to%20enjoy%20most%20and%20least.%20%20It%27s%20on%20the%20web%20at%0A%7C%0A%7C%20http:%2F%2Ftolkien.slimy.com%2Fbooks.html%0A%7C%0A%7C%20Let%20me%20know%20what%20you%20think%21%0A%7C%20Steuard%20Jensen%0A%0AThanks%20a%20lot%21%0A%0AKarl-%20Peder%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
