A%7C%20it%20will%20even%20give%20hints%20about%20which%20parts%20of%20those%20books%20you%27re%20likely%0A%7C%20to%20enjoy%20most%20and%20least.%20it%27s%20on%20t
%0A%22teepee%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%0Anews:3f0dd37e$0$45184$41nospam@nospam.net...%0A%0AAs%20an%20Istari%2C%20like%20Gandalf%2C%20Saruman%20probably%20couldn%27t%20remember%20much%20of%0AValinor%20or%20Aule.%0AAnd%20being%20chiefly%20concerned%20with%20Ring%20lore%20the%20Dwarves%20were%20not%20much%20use.%0APlus%2C%20if%20you%27re%20looking%20to%20become%20a%20major%20Power%2C%20like%20Saruman%20was%2C%20the%0ADwarves%20were%20pretty%20scattered%2C%20weak%20and%20wouldn%27t%20listen%20to%20a%20non-Dwarf%0Aanyway.%0AIMHO.%0A%0AT.A.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
