%0A%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%0Anews:41nospam@nospam.net...%0A%0AEverything%20anyone%20has%20ever%20wanted%20to%20say%20about%20Tolkien%20and%20his%20works%20has%0Aalready%20been%20said%20on%20this%20newsgroup.%0A%0ATsar%20Parmathule%0A%0APsst.%20What%27s%20this%20rumor%20about%20hobbits%20having%20wings%3F%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
%0AFinding%20or%20sorting%20from%20a%20list%20is%20a%20binary%20operation%20at%20its%20most%20efficient%2C%20ie%0Acomparing%20one%20item%20to%20another%20leads%20to%20greater%20than%2C%20less%20than%2C%20or%20equal%20to.%0AIf%20you%20know%20your%20powers%20of%202%2C%20the%20sequence%20is%200%2C1%2C2%2C4%2C8%2C16%2C32%2C64%2C&etc.%20%20The%0Aanswer%20should%20be%20that%20it%20requires%20at%20least%204%20weighings%2C%20or%202%5E4%20to%20attain%20100%25%0Acertainty%20for%20any%20list%20of%20less%20than%2016%20potential%20items%20to%20be%20compared%20and%0Aordered.%0A%0AWhy%20should%20it%20be%20binary%3F%20%20Well%20a%20set%20of%2012%20balls%2C%2011%20the%20same%20and%20one%20odd%20can%0Abe%20an%20ordered%20set%20of%201%2C%20then%2011%2C%20or%2011%2C%20then%201%2C%20depending%20on%20order%20sequence%0Afrom%20light%20to%20heavy%20or%20heavy%20to%20light%20and%20whether%20the%20oddball%20is%20light%20or%0Aheavy.%20%20In%20any%20case%2C%20we%20should%20divide%20by%202%20and%20compare%2C%20discard%20the%20empty%20half%0Aand%20then%20divide%20and%20compare%20the%20interesting%20half.%20%20That%20is%20a%20strict%20binary%0Amethod%20of%20locating%20or%20ordering.%20%20It%20is%20binary%20because%20the%20nature%20of%20comparison%0Ais%20one%20against%20another%2C%20or%20a%20natural%20operation%20of%20twos.%0A%0AThere%20are%20more%20efficient%20methods%20of%20ordering%20or%20locating%2C%20in%20an%20already%20ordered%0Alist.%20%20In%20our%20random%20list%2C%20we%20don%27t%20necessarily%20care%20about%20the%20sort%20order%2C%20but%0Awe%20do%20want%20to%20order%20in%201%20of%204%20possible%20ways.%20%20Working%20really%20hard%2C%20we%20develop%0Athe%20algorithm%20that%20I%20described%20and%20find%20we%20do%20not%20have%20100%25%20certainty%2C%20and%20if%0Awe%20calculate%20the%20times%20we%20attain%20100%25%20certainty%20as%20a%20ratio%20of%20total%0Apossibilities%20in%20a%20random%20ordering%2C%20we%20are%20damn%20close%20to%20being%20correct%20all%20of%0Athe%20time%20with%20three%20weighings.%20%20But%20the%20law%20is%20the%20law%2C%20in%20a%20list%20of%209%20to%2016%0Athings%2C%204%20weighings%20%5Bor%20operations%5D%20are%20needed%20to%20locate%20a%20specific%20item%2C%20or%20to%0Aorder%20a%20list%20using%20a%20binary%20search%20or%20a%20binary%20sort.%0A%0AAs%20a%20computer%20scientist%2C%20there%27s%20not%20much%20difference%20then%20in%20merely%20dividing%0Ainto%20sets%20of%201%2F2%20of%20the%20total%20concerned%20part%20of%20the%20list%20and%20locating%20that%20way%2C%0Athan%20in%20finagling%20for%20the%20most%20efficient%20method%20that%20is%20only%20more%20efficient%0Aover%20strict%20binary%20searches%20and%20sorts%20because%20of%20specific%20conditions.%20%20So%20as%20a%0Arule%20of%20thumb%20we%20simplify%20and%20go%20with%20the%20simple%20sort%2C%20because%20it%27s%20easy%20to%0Aimplement%2C%20easy%20to%20identify%2C%20and%20easy%20to%20maintain.%0A%0ATo%20sort%20an%20unordered%20list%2C%20the%20algorithm%20is%20thus:%20%20Divide%20in%20half%2C%20take%20the%0Ahalf%20that%20is%20greater%2C%20set%20as%20greater%2C%20and%20reiterate%20the%20same%20process%20with%20the%0Agreater%20half.%20%20When%20you%20get%20to%20finishing%20with%20a%20half%2C%20step%20back%20and%20do%20the%0Aother%20half.%20%20When%20all%20the%20recursion%20is%20done%2C%20the%20list%20is%20sorted%2C%20and%20sorted%20in%0Athe%20most%20efficient%20and%20most%20general%20manner%20possible.%20%20There%27s%20a%20term%20for%20this%0Aparticular%20sort%2C%20but%20the%20exact%20term%20escapes%20me%2C%20and%20it%27s%20not%20the%20bubble%20sort.%0A%0AA%20discussion%20can%20be%20made%20of%20comparisons%20of%20one%20against%20another%20against%20another%2C%0Abut%20even%20our%20primitive%20mental%20processes%20rebel%20against%20such%20an%20idea%20--%20why%20not%0Acompare%20one%20against%20another%20first%20and%20then%20match%20the%20%22winner%22%20against%20the%0Athird%3F%20%20It%20might%20be%20physically%20possible%20to%20envision%20greater%20comparison%0Aoperations%20than%20one%20against%20another%2C%20increasing%20sorting%20and%20locating%0Aefficiencies%20by%20so%20much%2C%20ie%202%5E3%20for%20a%20list%20of%20up%20to%20eight%20requiring%203%0A%22operations%22%20of%20comparison%20and%20switching%20into%20order%20is%20more%20time%20consuming%20than%0A3%5E2%20for%20a%20list%20of%20up%20to%20nine%20requiring%202%20%22operations%22%20of%20comparison%20and%0Aswitching%20into%20order.%20%20That%20is%2C%20envision%20a%20set%20of%20operands%20which%20immediately%0Aproduce%20an%20output%20for%20a%20comparison%20of%20one%20against%20another%20against%20another.%20%20It%0Ais%20difficult%2C%20but%20again%20I%20imply%20it%20is%20not%20impossible%2C%20only%20a%20major%20hassle%20to%0Ainvent%20and%20then%20implement.%0A%0A%0A
%0AI%20%20think%20from%20reading%20all%20accounts%20they%20were%20all%20%27old%20but%20vigorous%20when%20they%0Aarrived.%20In%20fact%2C%20even%20when%20Gandalf%20arrives%20he%20is%20already%20described%20as%0Ahaving%20grey%20hair%20and%20leaning%20on%20a%20staff%20%28essay%20on%20Istari%20UT%29.%0AAlthough%20the%20account%20of%20Saruman%20having%20%27raven%20hair%27%20is%20only%20found%20in%20the%0Aessay%20in%20UT%2C%20I%20suppose%20we%20could%20still%20acccept%20it%20as%20being%20the%20case.%20After%0Aall%2C%20taking%202000%20years%20to%20go%20from%20from%20raven%20black%20hair%20with%20a%20few%20streaks%0Aof%20%20white%2C%20to%20white%20hair%20with%20a%20few%20streaks%20of%20black%20isnt%20too%20bad%21%0AI%20know%20this%20sounds%20mad%20but%20my%20grandad%20is%20in%20his%2070s%20and%20still%20has%20dark%20hair%0Aalthough%20with%20streaks%20of%20%20grey%20so%20this%20is%20possible%20although%20generally%20rare%0Ain%20men%2C%20but%20then%20Saruman%20is%20a%20rare%20breed%20anyway.%0A%0ABefore%20anyone%20asks...%20no%2C%20my%20grandad%20is%20NOT%20Saruman%2C%20at%20least%20thats%20what%20he%0Asays.%0A%0ARegards%2C%0ADouglas%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
%0AI%20was%20surprised%20by%20how%20little%20romantic%20love%0Ascenes%2Fthemes%20were%20in%20the%0A%22Fellowship%20of%20the%20Ring%22%20movie.%0A%0ATotal%20of%20maybe%201%20minute%20in%20the%203+%20hour%20movie.%0A%0AQuestion%201.%0AAre%20there%20more%20romantic%20love%20scenes%2Fthemes%0Ain%20the%20movie%20&%20book%202%20and%203%3F%0A%0AQuestion%202.%0AFor%20me%2C%20the%20most%20memorable%20line%20&%20scene%20was%0A%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fgroups.google.com%2Fgroups%3Fselm=writing-0015.20021121%2540news.mantra.com&oe=UTF-8&output=gplain%0A%0AARWEN%20%20And%20to%20that%20I%20hold.%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20I%20would%20rather%20share%20one%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20lifetime%20with%20you%20than%20face%20all%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20the%20ages%20of%20the%20world%20alone.%0A%0AAre%20these%20lines%20from%20the%20book%3F%0A%0AI%20want%20to%20look%20up%20the%20scene%20in%20the%20book.%0ACould%20someone%20tell%20me%20where%20I%20can%20find%20it%0Aquickly%3F%0A%0AThank%20you.%0AHenry.%0A%0A%0A%0A__________________________________%0ADo%20you%20Yahoo%21%3F%0AYahoo%21%20SiteBuilder%20-%20Free%2C%20easy-to-use%20web%20site%20design%20software%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fsitebuilder.yahoo.com%0A%0A%0A
%0AIt%27s%20possible%20that%20it%20was%20the%20run%20off%20from%20Mordor%27s%20toilets%20%3Cdon%27t%20look%20at%0Ame%20like%20that%2C%20they%20had%20to%20go%20somewhere%21%3E%20I%27m%20sure%20that%20it%20would%20still%20be%0A%22the%20lasting%20monument%20to%20the%20dark%20labour%20of%20its%20slaves%22.%0AOk%2C%20I%20agree%20its%20probably%20mine%2Findustrial%20waste.%20But%20what%20was%20the%20toilet%0Asituation%20in%20Mordor%3F%0A%0AGraeme%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
%0AOn%20%207-Jul-2003%2C%41nospam@nospam.net%20%28Kalor%29%20wrote:%0A%0A%0AVery%20nice%20job.%20%20I%20can%27t%20imagine%20people%20taking%20this%20negatively.%20%20I%20loved%20it%21%0A%0A%20%20%20%20Just%20a%20monkey%2C%0A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20Scott%0A%0A--%0AEmail%20me%20at%20scott%20followed%20by%20644%2C%20at%20insightbb.com%0AVisit%20me%20at%20http:%2F%2F4dw.net%2Fmoonfriend%2Findex.html%0ANever%20start%20it%3B%20always%20finish%20it%0AI%27m%20a%20hawk%2C%20because%20I%27m%20a%20dove%0A%0A%0A
%0AOn%2015-Jul-2003%2C%41nospam@nospam.net%20%28Conrad%20Dunkerson%29%20wrote%0Ain%20message%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E:%0A%0A%0ADoes%20Tolkien%20say%20anything%20more%20about%20Entish%20in%20HoME%20or%20Letters%0Athan%20what%20appears%20in%20LotR%3F%20%20I%20wonder%20to%20what%20extent%20Elvish%0Ainfluence%20could%20still%20be%20detected%20in%20Entish%20by%2C%20say%2C%20the%20end%20of%0Athe%20Third%20Age.%20In%20fact%2C%20I%20wonder%20to%20what%20extent%20Entish%20lexicon%0Aand%20grammar%20were%20%2Aever%2A%20influenced%20by%20any%20Elvish%20tongue%2C%20even%0Agiven%20that%20the%20Ents%20were%20originally%20taught%20to%20speak%20by%20the%0AElves.%0A%0A--%0AJim%20Heckman%0A%0A%0A
%0AThis%20assumes%20that%20the%20term%20%22Ainur%22%20is%20defined%20to%20include%20the%20other%207%20orders.%0AThere%20is%20no%20reason%20to%20assume%20that%20it%20is.%20%20Particularly%2C%20there%20is%20no%20reason%20to%0Aassume%20that%20there%20would%20be%2C%20in%20Elvish%20mythology%2C%20any%20awareness%20of%20the%20existence%0Aof%20any%20%22higher%22%20orders.%0A%0AIn%20Chistian%20mythology%2C%20it%20is%20mainly%20the%20archangels%20%28leading%20the%20angels%29%20that%0Aare%20credited%20with%20having%20waged%20war%20against%20Lucifer.%20%20Presumably%2C%20dealing%20with%0Ascum%20like%20Satan%20was%20beneath%20the%20notice%20of%20any%20higher%20Orders.%0A%0AFurthermore%2C%20the%20Dionysian%20Nine%20are%20ranked%20in%20groups%20of%20three%20in%20terms%20of%0A%22closeness%20to%20God%22%2C%20not%20merely%20in%20terms%20of%20might%20or%20nobility.%20%20Those%20who%0Aentered%20Ea%20may%20be%20thought%20of%20as%20become%20separated%20from%20God%20in%20some%20sense%2C%0Ajustifying%20a%20ranking%20near%20the%20bottom%20on%20the%20Dionysian%20scale%20whatever%20their%0Alevel%20of%20power.%0A%0AThe%20Nine%20are%20generally%20ranked%20in%20groups%20of%20three.%20%20Perhaps%20those%20who%20entered%20Ea%0A%28ranked%20by%20power%20level%29%20are%20the%20Principalities%2C%20Archangels%2C%20and%20Angels%3B%20whereas%0Athose%20%22closest%20to%20God%22%20%28ranked%20by%20power%20level%29%20are%20the%20Seraphim%2C%20Cherubim%2C%20and%0AThrones.%20%20A%20third%20group%20occupy%20an%20intermediate%20position.%0A%0APerhaps%20Morgoth%20was%20a%20%22Seraph%22%2C%20who%2C%20upon%20entering%20Ea%2C%20assumed%20the%20status%20of%20a%0A%22Principality%22.%20%20Perhaps%20Ulmo%20was%20a%20Cherub%2C%20until%20at%20the%20dawn%20of%20Time%20he%0Aaccepted%20an%20assignment%20placing%20him%20distant%20from%20Illuvatar%20and%20in%20direct%20contact%0Awith%20mankind%2C%20and%20thus%20became%20an%20%22Archangel%22%20instead.%0A%0AHowever%2C%20the%20Talmud%20classifies%20Satan%20as%20a%20former%20Archangel%2C%20not%20a%20former%0APrincipality.%0A%0ANine%20Orders%20seems%20a%20bit%20much%20to%20me%2C%20and%20seems%20to%20me%20to%20be%20a%20late%20effort%20to%20give%0Aan%20overly-specific%20meaning%20to%20scriptural%20references.%20%20Seems%20to%20me%20that%0AChristian%20angelology%20should%20need%20%28at%20most%29%20four%20categories:%20%20the%20Seraphs%2C%0ACherubs%2C%20Archangels%20and%20Angels%2C%20with%20the%20latter%20two%20being%20sent%20into%20the%20World%2C%0Aand%20the%20former%20two%20remaining%20with%20God.%20%20If%20the%20latter%20two%20are%20those%20%20who%0Aentered%20Ea%2C%20they%20would%20correspond%20nicely%20to%20the%20Valar%20and%20Maiar.%0A%0A-%20John%20Whelan%0A%0A%0A
%0Aandrew%20wells%20wrote%3A%0Aneither%20of%20these%20were%20world%20wide%20or%20major%20wars.%20they%20were%20regional%20wars.%0Afurthermore%20the%20casualties%20in%20the%20great%20war%20were%20unprecedented.%20it%20made%0Athe%20crimean%20war%20a%20picnic%20by%20comparison.%20even%20the%20boer%20war%20claimed%0Arelatively%20few%20casualties%20from%20the%20brits.%20the%20great%20war%20was%20grand%0Aguignal%20slaughter%20of%20unbelievable%20magnitude.%20that%20is%20way%20everyone%0Abelieved%20it%20was%20the%20war%20to%20end%20all%20wars.%20no%20one%20could%20conceive%20of%0Aanything%20as%20bad%20as%20the%20great%20war.%0Abob%20kolker%0A
%0Aeen%20wilde%20ier%20wrote%3A%0Athe%20idea%20is%20not%20to%20die%20for%20your%20country%20but%20to%20make%20the%20other%20bastard%0Adie%20for%20his%20--%20george%20patton.%0Aanyone%20who%20wants%20to%20close%20with%20the%20enemy%20when%20it%20is%20possible%20to%0A-obliterate-%20him%20at%20a%20safe%20distance%20is%20a%20coo%20coo%20nut.%20i%20would%20trade%20all%0Athe%20valor%20in%20the%20world%20for%20a%20working%20gps%20system%20to%20guide%20in%20the%20jdams.%0Abob%20kolker%0A
%0Ano%20he%20tries%20to%20make%20the%20wrong%20decisions%0Aand%20usually%20succeeds%0Ahe%20continues%20to%20let%20his%20pride%20and%20arrogance%0Aoverwhelm%20any%20intelligent%20thought%20that%20attempts%20entry%20into%20his%20skull%0Aconsider%20morwens%20own%20lack%20of%20intellect%0Aperhaps%20turins%20condition%20is%20congenital%0A
%0Aroger%20clewley%20wrote%3A%0Aindustrial%20pollution%20was%20explicit%20in%20the%20section%20of%20lotr%20the%20cleansing%0Aof%20the%20shire.%20jrrt%20was%20a%20high%20class%20catholic%20gentleman%2C%20but%20he%20was%20also%0Aa%20luddite.%20not%20that%20i%20blame%20him.%20wwi%20in%20which%20he%20fought%20was%20the%20world%27s%0Afirst%20major%20industrial-%20war.%20valor%20and%20honor%20had%20less%20a%20part%20to%20play%0Athan%20hardware%20and%20throw%20weight.%0Abob%20kolker%0A
%20%20%20%20%20My%20theater%20got%20the%20teaser%20poster%20for%20RotK%20today.%20%20It%27s%20a%20close-up%0Aof%20Aragorn%27s%20face%2C%20much%20like%20the%20Frodo%20teaser%20for%20FotR%2C%20with%20the%20hilt%20of%0AAnduril%20held%20beneath%20his%20chin.%0A%0A%20%20%20%20%20More%20importantly%2C%20the%20poster%20came%20with%20a%20note%20saying%2C%20%22There%20will%0Abe%20no%20teaser%20trailer%20this%20summer.%22%20%20I%20believe%20the%20last%20theory%20I%20saw%20was%0Athat%20they%27d%20been%20planning%20to%20release%20a%20trailer%20in%20June%20or%20July%3B%20this%0Anixes%20that.%0A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20----j7y%0A%0A--%0A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%0Ajere7my%20tho%3Frpe%20%2F%20800-555-1212%20%20%20%20%20%20%22There%20is%20no%20spoon.%22%20%20%22SPOON%21%22%20%20%22There%0A%20%20%20%20%3E%3E%3E%20%41nospam@nospam.net%20%20%3C%3C%3C%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20is%20no%20spoon.%22%20%20%22SPOON%21%22%20%20%22There%20is%20no%0Ainvert%20liws%20to%20reply%20via%20email%20%20%20%20%20%20%20spoon.%22%20%20%22SPOON%21%22%20--%20The%20Tick%20vs.%20Neo%0A%0A%0A
%20donsaner:%09%20yeah%20-%20its%20trickier%20then%20you%20think%20at%20first.%20I%20thought%20I%20had%0Ait%20right%20away%20but%20did%20not.%20part%20of%20it%20is%20you%20need%20to%20measure%20a%20combination%20of%0Apotential%20heavy%2Flight%20with%20&quot%3Bcontrol&quot%3B%20balls%0A%20donsaner:%09%20the%20hard%20part%20is%20when%20you%20weight%204%20against%204%20and%20they%20are%20not%0Aequal%0A%20donsaner:%09%20you%20need%20to%20remove%203%20from%20the%20light%20side%2C%20transfer%203%20from%20the%0Aheavy%20side%20to%20the%20light%20side%20then%20move%203%20&quot%3Bcontrol&quot%3B%20balls%20to%20the%20heavy%0Aside%0A%20Wilbur07:%09%20Look%20at%20what%20I%20had%20just%20said.%20%20That%27s%20the%20solution.%20%20There%20are%0Atwo%20possible%20because%20either%20you%20at%20the%20end%20determine%20from%20a%20set%20of%204%20or%20from%20a%0Aset%20of%208.%0A%20donsaner:%09%20i%20will%20think%20it%20through%20further%20tonight%20and%20get%20back%20to%20you%0A%20Wilbur07:%09%20Hey%2C%20can%20you%20write%20a%20game%20program%20that%20allows%20you%20to%0Aexperiment%2C%20on-hands%3F%0A%20Wilbur07:%09%20Then%20I%27ll%20show%20you%2C%20I%27ll%20show%20you%20the%20soluchun%0A%20donsaner:%09%20hands%3F%0A%20Wilbur07:%09%20Meaning%2C%20make%20a%20game%20program%20that%20allows%20you%20to%20drag%20and%20drop%0A12%20balls%20onto%20or%20off%20of%20a%20balance%2C%20and%20that%20allows%20you%20to%20write%20on%20the%20balls%20if%0Ayou%20want.%20%20What%20if%20the%20ink%20is%20heavy%3F%20%20Then%20throw%20in%20a%20random%20odd-ball%20in%20the%0Aset%20of%20twelve.%20%20That%20way%20you%20can%20experimentally%20determine%20the%20algorithm.%0A%20Wilbur07:%09%20From%20the%20algorithm%2C%20you%20can%20then%20describe%20or%20identify%20the%0Aformula%20or%20solution.%0A%20donsaner:%09%20http:%2F%2Fmathforum.org%2Flibrary%2Fdrmath%2Fview%2F56766.html%0A%20Wilbur07:%09%20C%27mon%2C%20you%27re%20a%20programmer%2C%20aren%27t%20you%3F%20%20Use%20that%20Math.rand%28%29%0Afunction%21%0A%20donsaner:%09%20has%20a%20pretty%20good%20mathematical%20analysis%0A%20Wilbur07:%09%20right%2C%20like%20i%20have%20the%20time%20to%20look%20at%20the%20rigorous%20analysis%0Athat%20I%20just%2C%20in%20parallel%2C%20derived.%0A%0A%0A
