%22Bill%20O%27Meally%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3C52mRa.11897$41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A%0A%0AHrrmmm...%20this%20has%20been%20disputed%20before%2C%20but%20I%27d%20argue%20that%20Treebeard%0Awas%20talking%20about%20both%20trees%20AND%20Ents%3B%0A%0A%22%27The%20trees%20and%20the%20Ents%2C%27%20said%20Treebeard.%20%20%27I%20do%20not%20understand%0Aall%20that%20goes%20on%20myself%2C%20so%20I%20cannot%20explain%20it%20to%20you.%20%20Some%20of%0Aus%20are%20still%20true%20Ents%2C%20and%20lively%20enough%20in%20our%20fashion%2C%20but%0Amany%20are%20growing%20sleepy%2C%20going%20tree-ish%2C%20as%20you%20might%20say.%20%20Most%0Aof%20the%20trees%20are%20just%20trees%2C%20of%20course%3B%20but%20many%20are%20half%20awake.%0ASome%20are%20quite%20wide%20awake%2C%20and%20a%20few%20are%2C%20well%20ah%2C%20getting%20Entish.%0AThat%20is%20going%20on%20all%20the%20time.%0A....%0ASome%20of%20my%20kin%20look%20just%20like%20trees%20now%2C%20and%20need%20something%20great%0Ato%20rouse%20them%3B%20and%20they%20speak%20only%20in%20whispers.%20%20But%20some%20of%20my%0Atrees%20are%20limb-lithe%2C%20and%20many%20can%20talk%20to%20me.%20%20Elves%20began%20it%2C%20of%0Acourse%2C%20waking%20trees%20up%20and%20teaching%20them%20to%20speak%20and%20learning%0Atheir%20tree-talk.%22%0ATT%2C%20Treebeard%0A%0AThe%20whole%20passage%20was%20about%20how%20Ents%20and%20trees%20relate%20to%20each%20other%0Aand%20can%20become%20%27more%20treeish%27%20or%20%27more%20entish%27%20as%20time%20goes%20by.%20%20Then%0ATreebeard%20says%2C%20%27The%20Elves%20began%20it...%27.%20%20The%20question%20is%20then%20what%0A%27IT%27%20did%20the%20Elves%20begin%3F%20%20JUST%20%27trees%20becoming%20Entish%27%20or%20the%20entire%0Aspectrum%20of%20Treeishness%2FEntishness%20that%20Treebeard%20had%20just%20explained%3F%0AI%20have%20to%20believe%20it%20was%20the%20entire%20cycle%20rather%20than%20just%20one%20small%0Apiece.%0A%0A%0AWhich%20to%20me%20still%20suggests%20that%20the%20Elves%20taught%20the%20Ents%20to%20speak...%0Ahow%20else%20to%20instill%20the%20%27desire%20for%20speech%27%3F%20%20The%20Ents%20developed%20their%0Aown%20language%2C%20but%20only%20after%20they%20had%20learned%20how%20to%20speak%20from%20the%0AElves.%0A%0A%0A
