%22Conrad%20Dunkerson%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20skrev%20i%20en%20meddelelse%0Anews:41nospam@nospam.net...%0Anews:%41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A%0A%0A%0A%20%20%20Remember%20that%20Shagrat%20knew%20about%20Gollum%2C%20at%20least%2C%20though%20Gorbag%20did%20not.%0AShagrat%20had%20been%20at%20the%20Tower%20of%20Cirith%20Ungol%20when%20Gollum%20%22escaped%22%20from%0AMordor%2C%20with%20orders%20to%20let%20him%20through%2C%20and%20he%20had%20seen%20Gollum%20hobnobbing%0Awith%20Shelob%20since.%20%20Later%20in%20the%20chapter%20%22The%20Choices%20of%20Master%20Samwise%22%20we%0Aread%20that%20Shagrat%20had%20orders%20to%20send%20a%20description%20of%20everything%20found%20on%20a%0Atrespasser%2C%20specifically%20including%20%2Arings%2A%2C%20to%20Barad-d%FBr%2C%20and%20to%20no%20other%0Aplace.%20%20Since%20Sauron%20had%20no%20reason%20to%20suppose%20that%20any%20Ringbearer%20would%20try%0Ato%20enter%20Mordor%20through%20Cirith%20Ungol%20only%2C%20we%20can%20presume%20that%20all%20other%0Acaptains%20of%20the%20border%20watch%20had%20similar%20orders.%20%20Furthermore%2C%20since%20Sauron%0Ahad%20no%20specific%20reason%20to%20think%20that%20his%20only%20chance%20to%20lay%20hands%20on%20some%0ARingbearer%20or%20other%20would%20be%20on%20his%20borders%2C%20possibly%20%2Aall%2A%20his%20captains%20had%0Aorders%20that%20at%20least%20certain%20types%20of%20prisoners%20being%20taken%2C%20a%20full%0Adescription%20of%20everything%20found%20on%20them%20including%20rings%20be%20sent%20to%0ABarad-d%FBr.%0A%20%20%20Though%20Boromir%20seems%20not%20to%20have%20been%20searched%20when%20he%20was%20dying.%0APerhaps%20he%20would%20have%20if%20it%20had%20been%20Mordor-orcs%20in%20command%2C%20or%20if%20Ugl%FAk%20had%0Anot%20been%20in%20such%20a%20hurry%20to%20get%20back%20to%20Isengard%20with%20his%20hobbit%20prisoners.%0AOr%20perhaps%20they%20were%20too%20fearful%20of%20him%20even%20when%20he%20was%20alone%20and%20dying%2C%20or%0Aperhaps%20all%20three%20factors%20contributed.%0A%20%20%20The%20conversation%20between%20Shagrat%20and%20Gorbag%20indicates%20that%20orcs%20liked%20to%0Agossip.%20%20The%20quarrel%20between%20the%20soldier-orc%20and%20the%20tracker%20in%20the%20Morgai%0Avalley%20indicates%20the%20same.%20%20So%20presumably%20some%20knowledge%20of%20the%20Ring%20was%0Apercolating%20among%20the%20Mordor-orcs%2C%20at%20least%20the%20high-ranking%20ones.%0A%0AKarasu.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
