%22Steuard%20Jensen%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20skrev%20i%20en%20meddelelse%0Anews:NN%25Na.82$41nospam@nospam.net...%0A%0A%20%20%20%5B...%5D%0A%20%20%20My%20own%20impression%20is%20simply%20that%20the%20evil%20%22aura%22%20of%20Sauron%20strangled%0Aliving%20things%20and%20beauty%20in%20much%20the%20same%20way%20that%20the%20habitation%20of%20Elves%0Amade%20other%20places%20more%20beautiful.%20%20The%20Plain%20of%20Gorgoroth%20is%20no%20better%20than%0Athe%20lands%20near%20the%20Morannon%2C%20though%20its%20ugliness%20is%20different.%20%20The%20lands%0Aimmediately%20before%20the%20Black%20Gate%20had%20at%20the%20time%20been%20under%20Sauron%27s%0Acontrol%20for%20a%20long%20time%2C%20and%20his%20thoughts%20had%20presumably%20brooded%20more%20there%0Athan%20on%20many%20other%20areas%20of%20his%20realm%2C%20since%20it%20was%20the%20place%20where%20enemy%0Aarmies%20would%20be%20most%20likely%20to%20invade%2C%20and%20the%20place%20where%20the%20bulk%20of%20his%0Aown%20armies%20would%20issue%20forth.%0A%20%20%20It%20is%20described%20how%20the%20land%20of%20Ithilien%20had%20not%20been%20corrupted%2C%20since%20it%0Ahad%20not%20been%20under%20Sauron%27s%20control%20for%20very%20long%20-%20implying%20that%20if%0AIthilien%20had%20remained%20under%20Sauron%27s%20control%2C%20it%20would%20sooner%20or%20later%20have%0Adecayed%20too.%0A%20%20%20Of%20course%2C%20the%20valley%20of%20Morgai%20was%20somewhat%20closer%20to%20Barad-d%FBr%20than%20the%0AMorannon%20and%20the%20lands%20beyond%2C%20and%20the%20valley%20of%20Morgai%20was%20less%20corrupted.%0AThere%20were%20actually%20living%20things%20there%2C%20and%20a%20little%20running%20water.%20%20But%0Athe%20brooding%20thought%20of%20Sauron%20would%20probably%20have%20been%20less%20frequent%20and%0Aheavy%20on%20that%20area.%0A%0AVoron.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
