%22Why%20do%20you%20call%20yourself%20Moneypenne%2C%20Moneypenne%3F%22%0A%22Chaymes%2C%20it%20is%20my%20name.%22%0A%22Well%2C%20Oberon%20be%20damned%2C%20it%27s%20quite%20annoying.%20%20Who%20were%20you%2C%20or%20rather%2C%20what%0Awere%20you%20called%20in%20Amber%3F%22%0A%22A%20damned%20nuisance%2C%20or%20at%20least%20that%27s%20what%20Lord%20Random%20had%20referred%20me%20as%0Abeing%2C%20in%20Amber%20that%20is.%20%20He%20had%20termed%20me%20that%20because%20of%20our%20current%20troubles%0Awith%20Chaosium%20and%20the%20lines%20of%20succession.%22%0A%22Well%2C%20I%27m%20on%20this%20phone%20thing%2C%20Moneypenne%2C%20because%20my%20automobile%20has%20broken%0Adown.%22%0A%22You%20mean%20the%20Aston%20Martin%20that%20was%20assigned%20to%20you%20here%20on%20Earth%3F%22%0A%22Yes.%20%20Luckily%2C%20you%27re%20here%20in%20the%20very%20same%20city.%22%0A%22Oh%20Chaymes%2C%20what%20will%20Q%20think%20of%20it%20all%3F%22%0A%22Darling%2C%20you%20can%20go%20call%20up%20Q%20and%20tell%20him%20what%20I%20think.%22%0A%22And%20what%27s%20that%20Chaymes%3F%22%0A%22My%20goddamned%20Aston%20Martin%20internal%20combustion%20primitive%20thingy%20has%20broken%20down%0Aand%20it%20won%27t%20start%20up.%20%20It%20has%20this%20sad%20mournful%20churning%20sound%20to%20it%20when%20I%0Aturn%20the%20%27start%27%20key.%22%0A%22Chaymes%2C%20that%27s%20the%20way%20that%20engines%20are%20ignited%20on%20Earth%20at%20this%20time%20you%0Aknow.%20%20A%20spark%20from%20the%20sparkplug%20ignites%20the%20fuel%20in%20the%20chambers%2C%20and%20the%0Aelectric%20battery%20turns%20the%20whole%20motor%20to%20get%20fuel%20into%20what%20they%20call%20the%0Apiston.%22%0A%22Moneypenne%2C%20this%20is%20a%20damned%20backwater%20place%2C%20why%20are%20we%20here%3F%22%0A%22You%20know%20that%20Q%20assigned%20us%20here.%20%20I%20think%20Lord%20Corwin%20had%20some%20time%20spent%20in%0Athis%20very%20place%20years%20and%20years%20ago%2C%20before%20Lord%20Random%20became%20king%20in%20Amber.%22%0A%22Oh%20that%20explains%20it%20very%20well%2C%20Moneypenne.%20%20This%20damned%20speaking%20device%20is%0Adamned%20annoying%2C%20it%20is%20so%20damned%20small%20I%20can%20barely%20hold%20it%20properly%20in%20my%20hand%0Ato%20speak%20into%20it.%20%20Goddammit%2C%20Moneypenne%21%22%0A%22Chaymes%2C%20cool%20down.%20%20The%20mighty%20Q%20himself%20might%20get%20agitated%20with%20you%20acting%0Aup%20and%20all%20that.%22%0A%22You%20can%20tell%20Q%20he%20can%20suck%20my%20big%20Portugeez%20monkey%20wrench%2C%20Moneypenne%21%22%0A%22Oh%20Chaymes%2C%20it%27s%20only%20your%20%2Acar%2A%20that%20has%20broken%20down%21%20%20Nobody%20has%20died%20or%0Afallen%20into%20the%20Abyss.%22%0A%22Moneypenne%2C%20I%27m%20sick%20of%20this%20whole%20frame%21%22%0A%22Chaymes%2C%20hold%20on%20dear%20chap%2C%20I%27ll%20come%20and%20get%20you%20there.%22%0A%22Oh%2C%20okay%20my%20%27penne.%20%20I%20was%20about%20to%20crumple%20this%20metal%20thing%20into%20my%20fist%20you%0Aknow.%20%20I%27ll%20wait%20about%20for%20your%20arrival.%22%0A%22Chaymes%2C%20don%27t%20act%20strangely%21%20%20The%20mortals%20here%20aren%27t%20strong%20enough%20to%20dent%0Athe%20casings%20of%20their%20electronic%20devices%2C%20so%20don%27t%20go%20about%20crumpling%20things%20as%0Ayou%20say.%20%20Do%20you%20have%20your%20locator%20set%20to%20signaling%3F%22%0A%22Yes%2C%20as%20of%20now%20darling.%20%20I%20could%20use%20a%20good%20shag%20or%20two%20as%20well.%22%0A%22Chaymes%2C%20you%20are%20%2Aso%2A%20crude%21%20%20I%20like%20that%20in%20a%20travelling%20Lord%20of%20Amber%21%20%20I%27ll%0Abe%20there%20in%20a%20jiffy%2C%20and%20I%27ll%20bring%20the%2C%20you%20know.%22%0A%22Darling%2C%20I%20wish%20I%20could%20call%20you%20something%20normal%2C%20like%20L%27sheerra%2C%20or%20Leeli%2C%0Aor%20even%20Nanshi%20or%20something%20more%20Amberish.%20%20That%20damned%20Fleming%20sticks%20to%20my%0Athroat.%20%20Imagine%2C%20James%20fucking%20Bond%21%22%0A%22I%27m%20not%20exactly%20the%20Moneypenny%20in%20the%20books%20you%20know.%20%20There%27s%20Amber%20in%20me%0Asomewhere%20Chaymes%21%22%0A%22Whose%20goddamn%20idea%20was%20it%20to%20take%20from%20the%20literates%20of%20each%20frame%3F%22%0A%22Q%2C%20darling.%22%0A%22Is%20he%20done%20with%20the%20first%20sucking%20of%20the%20spanner%2C%20Moneypenne%3F%22%0A%22No%20darling%2C%20he%20sends%20word%20to%20have%20me%20do%20it.%22%0A%22Oh.%20%20By%20the%20way%2C%20I%27m%20on%20the%20outskirts%20of%20%27San%20Francisco%27%20the%20town%20to%20the%20north%0Aof%20where%20you%20are%2C%20I%20think%3F%22%0A%22I%27ve%20got%20you%20on%20my%20locator%20darling.%20%20Palm%20m515%20lookalike%2C%20not%20bad%20with%20my%0Askirt%20and%20blouse%2C%20hey%3F%22%0A%22I%20don%27t%20remember%20what%20you%27re%20wearing%2C%20Moneypenne.%22%0A%22The%20star%20spangled%20panties%20are%20all%20that%20count%20Chaymes.%20%20Hold%20where%20you%20are%2C%0AI%27ll%20sign%20off%20and%20show%20up%20shortly%21%22%0A%22Yes.%22%0A%22I%20love%20you%21%22%0A%22Eh%3F%20%20Just%20hurry%20up%20and%20get%20out%20here%20Moneypenne.%22%0A%22Bye%20bye%21%22%0A%5Bclick%5D%0A%5Bring%5D%0A%22Hello%3F%22%0A%22Chaymes%3F%22%0A%22Yes.%20%20Moneypenne%3F%22%0A%22Yes%20darling.%20%20While%20I%27m%20there%2C%20call%20me%20%27Pussy%20Galore%27%20will%20you%3F%22%0A%22Sure.%22%0A%22That%27s%20a%20chap.%20%20Bye%20bye%21%22%0A%22Bye.%22%0A%5Bclick%5D%0A%0A%0A
