%22paulh%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%0Anews:41nospam@nospam.net...%0A%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%0Awas%0Aof%0Atho..%0A%0ATevildo%20occupied%20the%20same%20place%20in%20the%20story%20of%20Beren%20and%20Luthien%20in%20the%0ABook%20of%20Lost%20Tales%20as%20Sauron%20was%20later%20to%20do%20in%20the%20Silmarillion%20--%20probably%0Ainspired%20by%20the%20Auld%20Enmity%20between%20cats%20and%20dogs%20%28Huan%29.%0A%0AI%20believe%20that%20another%20character%20in%20the%20BoLT%2C%20%27Tu%27%20or%20%27Tuvo%27%2C%20a%20wizard%20who%0Afinds%20and%20awakens%20two%20of%20the%20first%20Men%20in%20the%20land%20where%20they%20lie%20sleeping%0Abefore%20the%20first%20dawn%2C%20%27is%27%20Sauron%2C%20although%20he%20is%20not%20evil%2C%20IIRC.%20The%0Asimilarity%0Abetween%20Tu%2FTuvo%20and%20Th%FB%20%28Sauron%27s%20original%20name%20in%20the%20Silmarillion%29%20and%0Athe%20common%20skill%20in%20sorcery%20suggest%20that%20the%20character%20was%20drafted%20into%0AMorgoth%27s%0Aservice%20as%20the%20legendarium%20evolved%20into%20the%20recognisable%20%27Silmarillion%27%0Acycle%0Aaround%20the%20mid-1920s.%0A%0ASauron%27s%20roots%20in%20the%20mythology%20were%20not%20stable:%20initially%20he%20was%20Morgoth%27s%0Aservant%0Ain%20Valinor%20during%20his%20parole%2C%20and%20accompanied%20him%20back%20to%20Middle-earth%20as%0Ahis%0Aminion%2C%20but%20in%20later%20recensions%20his%20allegiance%20was%20with%20Morgoth%20from%20almost%0Athe%0Avery%20beginning.%20This%20may%20suggest%20that%2C%20like%20Galadriel%20and%20Gil-galad%2C%20his%0A%27back-%0Astory%27%20had%20to%20be%20extended%20backwards%20from%20the%20point%20at%20which%20Tolkien%20placed%0A%28re-placed%3F%29%20him%20in%20the%20legendarium%20and%20was%20consequently%20subject%20to%20some%0Areinterpretation%2C%20though%20in%20no%20way%20as%20drastic%20as%20that%20imposed%20on%20some...%0A%0AIt%20is%20perhaps%20worth%20stressing%20the%20point%20that%20Sauron%20was%20never%20conceived%20of%0Aas%0Ahaving%20been%20%27evil%20in%20the%20beginning%27%20--%20of%20course%2C%20not%20even%20Melkor%20had%20been%2C%0Abut%20Tolkien%20made%20something%20of%20a%20point%20of%20Sauron%27s%20having%20been%20good.%20Perhaps%0Athis%20consciousness%20reflects%20an%20awareness%20of%20story-internal%20and%0Astory-external%0Aaspects%20to%20the%20character%27s%20development.%0A--%0AMatthew%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
%22pawn%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20skrev%20i%20en%20meddelelse%0Anews:41nospam@nospam.net...%0A%0A%20%20%20Maiar%2C%20unless%20weakened%20by%20eg.%20committing%20evil%2C%20could%20form%20and%20dissolve%0Aphysical%20bodies%20at%20will.%20%20To%20them%20the%20body%20were%20like%20a%20raiment.%20%20Morgoth%0Alost%20that%20ability%2C%20as%20did%20Sauron%20and%20presumably%20the%20Balrogs.%20%20Saruman%20did%20as%0Awell%20-%20perhaps%20in%20part%20as%20a%20conscious%20punishment%20by%20the%20Valar%2C%20though%20the%0AIstari%20most%20certainly%20had%20been%20obliged%20to%20give%20up%20this%20ability%20during%20their%0Asojourn%20to%20Middle-earth%20from%20the%20beginning..%0A%20%20%20Gandalf%20would%20presumably%20have%20this%20ability%20restored%20to%20him%20in%20Aman.%20%20He%0Amight%20report%20back%20to%20the%20Valar%20in%20his%20incorporeal%20form%2C%20and%20then%20restore%20his%0Abody%20when%20spending%20time%20with%20the%20Ringbearers%20before%20they%20passed%20on%2C%20and%20when%0Aspending%20time%20with%20the%20Elves.%0A%0AKauv%E1.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
%22pawn%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0Aand%0Atowards%0Aare%0A%0AAt%20the%20sound%20of%20the%20voice%20commenting%20on%20his%20moniker%2C%20Two-Gun%20Moomin%20froze%2C%0Athe%20pen%20that%20the%20clerk%20had%20proffered%20to%20him%20immobile%20in%20his%20hand.%20He%20turned%0Ahis%20head%2C%20and%20his%20hard%2C%20grey%20eyes%20perceived%20that%20a%20door%20leading%20to%20the%20inner%0Asanctuaries%20of%20the%20hotel%20had%20opened%2C%20admitting%20the%20town%27s%20sheriff%2C%20a%0Awhite-haired%20man%20who%20looked%20as%20if%20someone%20had%20given%20him%20a%20good%20thrashing%20and%0Aa%20weedy%2C%20bespectacled%20little%20person%20in%20a%20snuff-coloured%20suit%20who%20was%20busily%0Ataking%20notes.%0A%20%20%22Hello%2C%20Little%20Bill%22%2C%20said%20Two-Gun%20calmly%20to%20the%20sheriff.%20%22It%27s%20been%20a%0Along%20time.%20You%20mind%20if%20I%20shack%20up%20here%20for%20a%20couple%20of%20days%3F%22%0A%20%20%22None%20at%20all%2C%20if%20you%20just%20hand%20over%20your%20shooting-piece%20for%20the%20duration.%0AThat%27s%20it%22%20%28%20this%20as%20Two-Gun%20slowly%20pulled%20his%20Walker-Colt%20out%20if%20its%0Aholster%20and%20handed%20it%20over%29%2C%20%22nice%20and%20easy%20does%20it.%20I%20just%20wish%20English%20Bob%0Ahere%20had%20been%20as%20reasonable%20as%20you%20was.%22%0A%20%20%22You%20know%20him%2C%20sheriff%3F%22%20said%20the%20clerk.%20%22Can%20you%20testify%20that%20he%27s%20not%20a%0Avampire%3F%22%0A%20%20%22I%20can%22%2C%20chuckled%20Little%20Bill.%20%22Two%20Gun%20has%20a%20taste%20for%20the%20ladies%20all%0Aright%2C%20but%20not%20in%20that%20particular%20manner.%20Sometimes%20he%20ties%20a%20bow%20on%20his%0Atail%2C%20that%27s%20all.%22%0A%20%20Right%20then%2C%20the%20door%20to%20the%20street%20opened%20and%20a%20Sergeant%20in%20a%20Foreign%0ALegion%20uniform%20entered.%0A%20%20%22Deserteur%21%22%20he%20shouted%2C%20pointing%20at%20Two-Gun.%20%22You%20arre%20under%20arrrest%21%22%0A%0A%D6jevind%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
