AP%0A%0AFollowing%20hard%20on%20the%20decision%20to%20scrap%20the%20Concorde%2C%20there%20is%20another%0Amajor%20blow%20to%20Anglo-French%20aerospace.%20%20Both%20countries%20have%20decided%20to%0Aground%20their%20fleet%20of%20Balrogs%2C%20and%20top%20officials%20have%20strongly%0Asuggested%20that%20they%20will%20be%20mothballed.%0A%0ASeveral%20balrogs%20have%20lost%20their%20wings%20shortly%20after%20takeoff%20and%20at%0Aleast%20one%20crashed%20to%20its%20ruin%20on%20the%20side%20of%20a%20mountain%2C%20according%20to%0Aaviation%20records.%0A%0AYoyodyne%20Industries%20%28%22Where%20the%20future%20begins%20tomorrow%22%29%2C%20the%0Aprincipal%20contractor%20on%20the%20%20project%2C%20has%20poo-pooed%20the%20reports%2C%0Apointing%20to%20expert%20testimony%20that%20the%20balrogs%20never%20had%20wings%20to%20begin%0Awith%20and%20so%20could%20not%20lose%20them.%0A%0AThey%20also%20pointed%20out%20that%20there%20is%20currently%20no%20equivalent%20aircraft%0Athat%20could%20make%20the%20trans%20Hithlium%20run%20in%20the%20same%20time.%0A%0AAsked%20to%20comment%2C%20PM%20Blair%20remarked%20%22we%20can%27t%20even%20find%20sodding%20WMDs%0Aand%20you%20expect%20me%20to%20find%20wings%20on%20Balrogs%3F%20%20Bugger%20off%2C%20Yank.%22%0A%0AThe%20Balrogs%20were%20unavailable%20for%20comment.%0A%0A%0A%0A%20--%0ASindamor%20Pandaturion%0A%5Bremove%20-remove-%20to%20reply%5D%0A%0A%0A
