For%20auction%20on%20Ebay:%0A%0A2%20deluxe%20LOTR%20gift%20packs%20-%0Aone%20featuring%20the%20nine:%0AGandalf%2C%20Legolas%2C%20Gimli%2C%20Merry%20and%20Pippen%2C%20Sam%2C%20Boromir%2C%0AAragorn%28Strider%29%0AThe%20pack%20comes%20with%20the%20one%20ring%2C%20and%20a%20map%20of%20middle%20earth.%0ANice%20collectible.%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fcgi.ebay.ca%2Fws%2FeBayISAPI.dll%3FViewItem&category=44053&item=3139142351%0A%0Athe%20second%20pack%20is%20the%20same-%20except%20that%20it%20contains%20a%20variant.%0AInstead%20of%20Gandalf%20the%20Grey-%20you%20get%20Gandalf%20the%20white.%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fcgi.ebay.ca%2Fws%2FeBayISAPI.dll%3FViewItem&category=44053&item=3139142351%0A%0AThere%20were%20only%205000%20of%20these%20deluxe%20packs%20made%20-%0A%0A%0AThanks%0AKimba%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
From%20the%20Guinness%20Book%20of%20Records%20%28admittedly%20only%20the%201994%20edition%29.%0A%0AThere%20is%20a%20recorded%20case%2C%20under%20optimal%20acoustic%20conditions%2C%20of%20the%20human%0Avoice%20being%20detectable%20at%20a%20distance%20of%2017km%2C%2010.5%20miles%2C%20across%20still%20water%0Aat%20night.%0A%0AThe%20highest%20scientifically%20measured%20emission%20has%20been%20one%20of%20128dbA%20at%202.5m%2C%0A8ft%202in%2C%20by%20the%20screaming%20of%20Simon%20Robinson%20of%20McLaren%20Vale%2C%20South%20Australia%0Aat%20%22The%20Guiness%20Challenge%22%20at%20Adelaide%2C%20Australia%20on%2011%20Nov%201988.%0A%0AThe%20world%27s%20noisiest%20land%20animals%20are%20the%20howling%20monkeys%20%28Alouatta%29%20of%0ACentral%20and%20South%20America.%20%20...%20%20Once%20in%20full%20voice%20they%20can%20be%20heard%0Aclearly%20up%20to%2016km%2C%2010%20miles%2C%20away.%0A%0AAndrew%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
Furio97%20said:%0A%0AYes.%0A%0ASam%20overhears%20Gollum%20saying%20to%20himself:%0A%0A%20%20%20%27But%20the%20Precious%20holds%20the%20promis%2C%27%20the%20voice%20of%20Smeagol%20objected.%0A%20%20%20%27Then%20take%20it%2C%27%20said%20the%20other%2C%20%27and%20let%27s%20hold%20it%20ourselfs%21%20Then%20we%0Ashall%20be%20master%2C%20%2Fgollum%2F%21%27%0A%20%20%20%27But%20not%20the%20nice%20hobbit%3F%27%0A%20%20%20%27Oh%20no%2C%20not%20if%20it%20doesn%27t%20please%20us.%20Still%20he%27s%20a%20Baggins%2C%20my%20precious%2C%0Ayes%2C%20a%20Baggins.%20A%20Baggins%20stole%20it.%20He%20found%20it%20and%20he%20said%20nothing%2C%0Anothing.%20We%20hates%20Bagginses.%27%0A%20%20%20%27No%2C%20not%20this%20Baggins.%27%0A%20%20%20%27Yes%2C%20every%20Baggins.%20All%20peoples%20that%20keep%20the%20Precious.%20We%20must%20have%0Ait%21%27%0A%0ASo%20it%20would%20appear%20that%20Gollum%20knew%20that%20both%20Bilbo%20and%20Frodo%20were%20Bagginses%0Aand%2C%20moreover%2C%20it%20would%20appear%20that%20he%20understood%20the%20significance%20and%0Apurpose%20of%20last%20names%20which%20is%20more%20than%20I%20can%20say%20for%20most%20of%20the%0Acharacters%20in%20the%20book.%20Heridetary%20last%20names%20seem%20to%20have%20been%20particular%0Ato%20Hobbits%20and%20the%20Men%20of%20Bree.%20Perhaps%20Smeagol%27s%20people%20also%20had%20familial%0Anames%20way%20back%20when.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%22The%20narrative%20ends%20here.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20There%20is%20no%20reason%20to%20think%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%2F%2F%0A%28%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20that%20any%20more%20was%20ever%20written.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%2F%2F%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20The%20manuscript%2C%20which%20becomes%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20increasingly%20rapid%20towards%20the%20end%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%0A%28%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20peters%20out%20in%20a%20scrawl.%22%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%7C%0A%7C%7C%20%20%20%20%20-Christopher%20Tolkien%2C%20_The%20Lost%20Road_%20%20%2F%2F%20%7C%7C%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
Furio97%20wrote:%0A%0A%0AIt%27s%20a%20re-assignment%20of%20Denethor%27s%20words%20in%20%27Minas%20Tirith%27%3B%0A%0A%3FWhat%20then%20is%20your%20wisdom%3F%3F%20said%20Gandalf.%0A%3FEnough%20to%20perceive%20that%20there%20are%20two%20follies%20to%20avoid.%20To%20use%20this%20thing%0Ais%20perilous.%20At%20this%20hour%2C%20to%20send%20it%20in%20the%20hands%20of%20a%20witless%20halfling%0Ainto%20the%20land%20of%20the%20Enemy%20himself%2C%20as%20you%20have%20done%2C%20and%20this%20son%20of%20mine%2C%0Athat%20is%20madness.%3F%0A%3FAnd%20the%20Lord%20Denethor%20what%20would%20he%20have%20done%3F%3F%0A%3FNeither.%20But%20most%20surely%20not%20for%20any%20argument%20would%20he%20have%20set%20this%20thing%0Aat%20a%20hazard%20beyond%20all%20but%20a%20fool%3Fs%20hope%2C%20risking%20our%20utter%20ruin%2C%20if%20the%0AEnemy%20should%20recover%20what%20he%20lost.%0A%0A%0A
Furio97%2C%20en%20una%20muestra%20de%20su%20admirable%20prosa%2C%20afirm%F3%20en%20el%20mensaje%41nospam@nospam.net%20que:%0A%0AFingolfin%2C%20for%20being%20at%20the%20same%20time%20friend%20and%20foe%20of%0AFeanor%20and%20his%20sons%2C%20for%20being%20loyal%20to%20the%20Valar%20and%0Aat%20the%20same%20time%20returning%20to%20Middle%20Earth%2C%20for%20being%0Aabandoned%20by%20Feanor%20and%20crosiing%20the%20Helcaraxe%2C%20and%20still%0Atrying%20to%20pact%20with%20Maedhros.%0A%0A--%0ABuddy%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
Gonzalo%20Diethelm%20%20in%20%3C3f03dbe7$41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20scripsit:%0A%0AYes%2C%20Bilbo%20went%20as%20well%20as%20Frodo.%0A%0A%0ANo%2C%20Sam%20didn%27t%20go%20to%20the%20West.%20When%20Frodo%20and%20Sam%20depart%20from%20the%0AShire%2C%20at%20the%20end%20of%20the%20book%2C%20they%20meet%20Elrond%2C%20Galadriel%20and%20Bilbo%0Awho%20are%20going%20to%20the%20Havens.%20Frodo%20agrees%20to%20come%20with%20them%20%28%22The%0ARing-bearers%20should%20go%20together%22%29%2C%20but%20when%20Sam%20asks%20frodo%20if%20he%20can%0Acome%2C%20as%20well%2C%20Frodo%20answers:%20%22No%2C%20Sam.%20Not%20yet%20anyway%2C%20not%20further%0Athan%20the%20Havens.%20Though%20you%20too%20were%20a%20Ring-bearer%2C%20if%20only%20for%20a%0Alittle%20while.%20Your%20time%20may%20come.%22%20Sams%20rides%20with%20them%20to%20the%20Havens%2C%0Asees%20them%20sailing%20to%20the%20West%2C%20and%20goes%20back%20to%20the%20Shire%0Aeventually.%20His%20words%20%22Well%2C%20I%27m%20back%22%20close%20the%20book.%0A%0A--%0AMarie-Lan%20Nguyen%0A%AB%A0Et%20ideo%20ego%20adulescentulos%20existimo%20in%20scholis%20stultissimos%20fieri%2C%0Aquia%20nihil%20ex%20his%2C%20quae%20in%20usu%20habemus%2C%20aut%20audiunt%20aut%20vident.%A0%BB%20%28P%E9trone%29%0A%3Chttp:%2F%2Fwww.pip-pip.org%2F%3E%0A%0A%0A
Gonzalo%20Diethelm%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3C3f255a43$41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A%0A%22As%20three%20great%20Jewels%20they%20were%20in%20form.%20But%20not%20until%20the%20End%2C%20when%0AF%EBanor%20shall%20return%20who%20perished%20ere%20the%20Sun%20was%20made%2C%20and%20sits%20now%20in%0Athe%20Halls%20of%20Awaiting%20and%20comes%20no%20more%20among%20his%20kin%3B%20not%20until%20the%0ASun%20passes%20and%20the%20Moon%20falls%2C%20shall%20it%20be%20known%20of%20what%20substance%0Athey%20were%20made.%22%0ASilm%2C%20Of%20the%20Silmarils%20and%20the%20Unrest%20of%20the%20Noldor%0A%0A%0A
Gonzalo%20Diethelm%20wrote:%0A%0A%0AHarperCollins%20will%20be%20issuing%20a%20Facsimile%20First%20Edition%20of%20the%0AHobbit%20one%20of%20these%20days:%0A%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fwww.tolkien.co.uk%2Fbooks%2Fdefault.asp%3Fid=7642%0A%0A--%20FotW%0A%0AReality%20is%20for%20those%20who%20cannot%20cope%20with%20Middle-earth.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
Gonzalo%20Diethelm%20wrote:%0A%0A%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fwww.ringgame.net%2Friddles.html%0A%0A--%0A%0ALinards%20Ticmanis%0A%0A%20The%20Master%20said%2C%20%22The%20business%20of%20laying%20on%20the%20colors%20follows%20the%0Apreparation%20of%20the%20plain%20ground.%22%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
Graham%20Lockwood%20%3CGondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3CBB2E45AA.94F7%25GondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A%0AOf%20%27Osanwe-kenta%27%20from%20VT%2039%3B%0A%0AThere%20are%20actually%20a%20number%20of%20texts%20which%20were%20never%20published%20in%0AHoME%20%28or%20indeed%2C%20never%20published%20at%20all%29%20that%20have%20some%20very%0Ainteresting%20information%20on%20Tolkien%27s%20world%20but%20which%20don%27t%20relate%20to%0Athe%20development%20of%20a%20particular%20story%20or%20aspect%20of%20the%20mythology%0A%28which%20seems%20to%20have%20been%20Christopher%27s%20focus%29.%20%20The%20Osanwe-kenta%0Aessay%20is%20a%20good%20example.%20%20It%20has%20alot%20of%20very%20interesting%20information%0Aabout%20the%20abilities%20and%20limitations%20of%20the%20Ainur.%20%20Specifically%2C%20it%20is%0Aan%20essay%20on%20%27telepathy%27%20in%20Middle-earth%2C%20but%20it%20ranges%20about%20quite%20a%0Abit.%0A%0A%0A
Graham%20Lockwood%20%3CGondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3CBB358B5C.9ADD%25GondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A%0A%0AIn%20addition%20to%20the%20other%20answers%20given...%20keep%20in%20mind%20that%20Sauron%20was%0A%27faking%27.%20%20He%20wasn%27t%20really%20%27driven%20out%27%20so%20much%20as%20he%20%27chose%20to%0Awithdraw%27.%20%20Dol%20Guldur%20wasn%27t%20destroyed%2C%20and%20indeed%20it%20remained%20under%0Ahis%20control.%20%20He%20just%20left%20to%20set%20up%20shop%20in%20Mordor%20and%20let%20the%20White%0ACouncil%20think%20they%20had%20thwarted%20him.%0A%0A%0A
Graham%20Lockwood%20%3CGondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3CBB384ACB.9CC8%25GondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A%0A%0AAll%20quite%20true%2C%20but%20from%20listening%20to%20the%20commentaries%20I%20got%20the%0Adistinct%20impression%20that%20they%20also%20just%20didn%27t%20know%20any%20better.%20%20We%0Acan%20always%20find%20a%20possible%20explanation%2C%20but%20in%20many%20cases%20the%20answer%0Ais%20probably%20just%20that%20they%20made%20a%20mistake.%0A%0AAs%20another%20example%2C%20when%20the%20first%20movie%20came%20out%20there%20was%20a%0Adiscussion%20here%20about%20why%20Sting%20glowed%20in%20Moria%20but%20Glamdring%20didn%27t.%0AThe%20theory%20put%20forth%20was%20that%20maybe%20they%20didn%27t%20want%20to%20confuse%20the%0Aaudience%20since%20it%20had%20not%20been%20explained%20that%20Gandalf%27s%20sword%20was%0Aelvish%20like%20Sting.%20%20However%2C%20one%20of%20the%20three%20writers%20mentioned%0Agetting%20asked%20about%20this%20%28think%20it%20was%20Boyens%29%20and%20Jackson%20seemed%0Aconfused%20as%20to%20why%20Gandalf%27s%20sword%20should%20glow.%0A%0AThat%20said%2C%20for%20the%20majority%20of%20the%20movies%20we%20don%27t%20actually%20SEE%20their%0Afeet.%20%20Sean%20Astin%20actually%20kept%20a%20tally%20of%20how%20many%20days%20he%20had%20to%0Awear%20the%20prosthetics%20and%20yet%20his%20feet%20were%20never%20filmed...%20it%20was%0Asomewhere%20north%20of%20100%20days%20as%20I%20recall.%20%20It%20might%20well%20have%20been%0Apossible%20to%20just%20apply%20fake%20hair%20to%20the%20tops%20of%20the%20feet%20and%20just%20give%0Athem%20a%20stick-on%20prosthetic%20sole%20to%20protect%20the%20bottom%20of%20their%20feet.%0A%0A%0A
Graham%20Lockwood%20%3CGondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3CBB3AA25F.9E91%25GondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A%0A%0AThere%20isn%27t%20much%20more%20than%20that%20about%20it%20or%20sign%20language%20in%20general%3B%0A%0A%22They%20knew%20of%20such%20systems%20of%20gestures.%20%20The%20Eldar%20possessed%20a%20fairly%0Aelaborate%20system%2C%20%28Note%2034%2C%20p.%20416%29%20containing%20a%20large%20number%20of%0Aconventional%20gesture-signs%2C%20some%20of%20which%20were%20as%20%27arbitrary%27%20as%20those%0Aof%20phonetic%20systems.%20%20That%20is%2C%20they%20had%20no%20more%20obvious%20connexion%20with%0Aself-explanatory%20gestures%20%28such%20as%20pointing%20in%20a%20desired%20direction%29%0Athan%20had%20the%20majority%20of%20vocal%20elements%20or%20combinations%20with%20%27echoic%27%0Aor%20imitative%20words%20%28such%20as%20%2Amama.%20Q%20mama%20%27sheep%27%2C%20or%20%2Ak%28a%29wak%2C%20Q%0Aquako%20%27crow%27%29.%0AThe%20Dwarves%20indeed%2C%20as%20later%20became%20known%2C%20had%20a%20far%20more%20elaborate%0Aand%20organized%20system.%20%20They%20possessed%20in%20fact%20a%20secondary%20tengwesta%0A%5B%27system%20or%20code%20of%20signs%27%2C%20%27language%27%5D%20of%20gestures%2C%20concurrent%20with%0Atheir%20spoken%20language...%22%0AQuendi%20and%20Eldar%2C%20Appendix%20D%0A%0AThe%20note%20referenced%20in%20the%20above%20passage%20states%3B%0A%0A%22Note%2034%20%28p.%20394%29%0AIn%20genuine%20independent%20use%20mainly%20employed%20between%20persons%20out%20of%0Aearshot:%20the%20Elves%20had%20astonishingly%20acute%20eyesight%20at%20a%20distance.%0AThese%20%27signals%27%20were%20really%20distinct%20from%20the%20gestures%20%28especially%0Athose%20of%20the%20hands%29%20made%20as%20concomitants%20to%20speech%20and%20additions%20to%0Atone-changes%20for%20the%20conveyance%20of%20feeling%2C%20though%20some%20of%20the%0Agestures%20in%20both%20systems%20were%20similar.%20%20The%20Elves%20made%20considerable%0Ause%20of%20the%20concomitant%20gestures%2C%20especially%20in%20oration%20or%0Arecitation.%22%0A%0A%0A
Graham%20Lockwood%20%3CGondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3CBB3C019A.9F3D%25GondhirAtC%2AH%2AO%2AK%2AL%2AI%41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0AIt%20is%20possible%20that%20the%20swords%20of%20Celegorm%2C%20Caranthir%20and%20Curufin%0Aescaped%20the%20orcs.%20%20Those%20three%20sons%20of%20Feanor%20were%20not%20killed%20by%0AMorgoth%27s%20armies%20but%20by%20thier%20own%20elven%20kin%20in%20Doriath.%20%20It%20is%0Apossible%20that%20fugitives%20of%20Doriath%20took%20the%20swords%20with%20them%20to%20the%0AMouths%20of%20Sirion.%20%20From%20there%20they%20would%20have%20ended%20up%20either%20over%20the%0Asea%20on%20Tol%20Erresea%2C%20or%20the%20could%20have%20remained%20in%20Middle%20Earth%20in%0AImladris%2C%20the%20Grey%20Havens%20or%20in%20Eregion.%0A%0AAlso%2C%20Celebrimbor%20may%20have%20been%20given%20a%20Feanorian%20sword%20by%20his%20father%0ACurufin.%20%20Of%20course%20this%20wouldn%27t%20have%20saved%20it%20from%20orcs%20as%0ACelebrimbor%20was%20slain%20by%20Sauron%27s%20army%20in%20Eregion%20during%20the%20second%0Aage.%0A%0AAR%0A%0A%0A
Graham%20Lockwood%20wrote:%0A%0AOther%20may%20have%20had%20that%20ability%20too.%0A%0AManw%EB%20is%20known%20to%20be%20able%20to%20control%20the%20weather.%0A%0AAnd%20while%20the%20Valar%20had%20a%20non-interference%20policy%2C%20letting%20a%20wind%20go%20in%0Athe%20right%20direction%20at%20the%20right%20time%20is%20no%20big%20deal.%0A%0A--%0AKristian%20Damm%20Jensen%20%20%20%20%7C%20If%20you%20can%27t%20take%20the%20trouble%20to%0Adamm%20%28at%29%20ofir%20%28dot%29%20dk%20%7C%20make%20your%20posting%20readable%2C%20I%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%20can%27t%20take%20the%20trouble%20to%20read%20it.%0A%0A%0A%0A
Graham%20Lockwood%20wrote:%0A%5B...%5D%0A%0A%22Excellent%22%20--%20Imladris%20Chronicle.%20%22A%20must%20for%20all%20serious%20Tolkien%20fans.%22%0A--%20Tirith%20Times.%20%22Thought-provocative%20and%20insightful%2C%20though%20it%20is%20a%20pity%0Ait%20hadn%27t%20been%20published%20earlier.%22%20--%20Valinor%20Monthly%20%28Literary%20Review%0ASupplement%29.%0A%0AArchie%0A%0A--%0A%22I%20have%20told%20my%20sons%20that%20they%20are%20not%20under%20any%0Acircumstances%20to%20take%20part%20in%20massacres%2C%20and%20that%0Athe%20news%20of%20massacres%20of%20enemies%20is%20not%20to%20fill%20them%0Awith%20satisfaction%20or%20glee.%22%0A%0AKurt%20Vonnegut%2C%20_Slaughterhouse-Five_%0A%0A%0A
Gregg%20Cattanach%20said:%0A%7Bsnip%7D%0A%0AAnd%20if%20he%20did%2C%20he%20certainly%20didn%27t%20do%20a%20very%20good%20job%20of%20it%2C%20since%20the%20winds%0Achanged%20right%20in%20the%20middle%20of%20battle...%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%22The%20narrative%20ends%20here.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20There%20is%20no%20reason%20to%20think%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%2F%2F%0A%28%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20that%20any%20more%20was%20ever%20written.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%2F%2F%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20The%20manuscript%2C%20which%20becomes%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20increasingly%20rapid%20towards%20the%20end%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%0A%28%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20peters%20out%20in%20a%20scrawl.%22%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%7C%0A%7C%7C%20%20%20%20%20-Christopher%20Tolkien%2C%20_The%20Lost%20Road_%20%20%2F%2F%20%7C%7C%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
Gregg%20Cattanach%20wrote:%0A%0AHe%20certainly%20did%20not%20%22wait%20for%20a%20natural%20strong%20easterly%20wind%22.%20It%20is%0Astrongly%20suggested%20in%20the%20book%2C%20that%20he%20made%20his%20attack%20prematurely%0Abecause%20Aragorn%20revealed%20himself%20in%20the%20palantir.%20So%20either%20he%20created%0Athe%20wind%20or%20it%20was%20a%20lucky%20coincidence.%0A%0A-%0AKristian%20Damm%20Jensen%20%20%20%20%7C%20If%20you%20can%27t%20take%20the%20trouble%20to%0Adamm%20%28at%29%20ofir%20%28dot%29%20dk%20%7C%20make%20your%20posting%20readable%2C%20I%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%20can%27t%20take%20the%20trouble%20to%20read%20it.%0A%0A%0A%0A
Gregg%20Cattanach%20wrote:%0A%0AIt%20is%20certainly%20strongly%20implied%20that%20they%20are%20cannibals%2C%20although%20I%20don%27t%0Athink%20it%20is%20stated%20explicitly.%20%20I%27ll%20leave%20someone%20else%20to%20dig%20out%20the%0Areferences%21%0A%0AAndrew%0A--%0AAndrew%20Wells%0AReplace%20nospam%20with%20my%20first%20name%20to%20reach%20me%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
HAL%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3CXns93ACD62C0D20FHALHALCOM@63.223.5.254%3E...%0A%0A%0AIn%20the%20book%20it%20seems%20to%20be%20implied%20that%20Arwen%20switched%20places%20with%0AFrodo%3B%0A%0A%22But%20the%20Queen%20Arwen%20said:%20%20%27A%20gift%20I%20will%20give%20you.%20%20For%20I%20am%20the%0Adaughter%20of%20Elrond.%20%20I%20shall%20not%20go%20with%20him%20now%20when%20he%20departs%20to%0Athe%20Havens%3B%20for%20mine%20is%20the%20choice%20of%20Luthien%2C%20and%20as%20she%20so%20have%20I%0Achosen%2C%20both%20the%20sweet%20and%20the%20bitter.%20%20But%20in%20my%20stead%20you%20shall%20go%2C%0ARing-Bearer%2C%20when%20the%20time%20comes%2C%20and%20if%20you%20then%20desire%20it.%20%20If%20your%0Ahurts%20grieve%20you%20still%20and%20the%20memory%20of%20your%20burden%20is%20heavy%2C%20then%0Ayou%20may%20pass%20into%20the%20West%2C%20until%20all%20your%20wounds%20and%20weariness%20are%0Ahealed...%27%22%0ARotK%2C%20Many%20Partings%0A%0AAnd%20this%20impression%20was%20maintained%20by%20one%20of%20Tolkien%27s%20early%20letters%3B%0A%0A%22...and%20so%20certain%20%27mortals%27%2C%20who%20have%20played%20some%20great%0Apart%20in%20Elvish%20affairs%2C%20may%20pass%20with%20the%20Elves%20to%0AElvenhome.%20%20Thus%20Frodo%20%28by%20the%20express%20gift%20of%20Arwen%29%20and%0ABilbo%2C%20and%20eventually%20Sam%20%28as%20adumbrated%20by%20Frodo%29%3B%20and%20as%0Aa%20unique%20exception%20Gimli%20the%20Dwarf%2C%20as%20friend%20of%20Legolas%0Aand%20%27servant%27%20of%20Galadriel.%22%0AJRRT%2C%20Letters%20%23154%0A%0AHowever%2C%20later%20Tolkien%20clarified%20%28or%20modified%29%20the%20concept%20a%20bit%3B%0A%0A%22Arwen%20was%20the%20first%20to%20observe%20the%20signs%2C%20and%20gave%20him%20her%0Ajewel%20for%20comfort%2C%20and%20thought%20of%20a%20way%20of%20healing%20him.%20%2A%22%0A%0A%22%2AIt%20is%20not%20made%20explicitly%20clear%20how%20she%20could%20arrange%0Athis.%20%20She%20could%20not%20of%20course%20just%20transfer%20her%20ticket%20on%0Athe%20boat%20like%20that%21%20%20For%20any%20except%20those%20of%20Elvish%20race%0A%27sailing%20West%27%20was%20not%20permitted%2C%20and%20any%20exception%0Arequired%20%27authority%27%2C%20and%20she%20was%20not%20in%20direct%0Acommunication%20with%20the%20Valar%2C%20especially%20not%20since%20her%0Achoice%20to%20become%20%27mortal%27.%20%20What%20is%20meant%20is%20that%20it%20was%0AArwen%20who%20first%20thought%20of%20sending%20Frodo%20into%20the%20West%2C%20and%0Aput%20in%20a%20plea%20for%20him%20to%20Gandalf%20%28either%20direct%20or%20through%0AGaladriel%2C%20or%20both%29%2C%20and%20she%20used%20her%20own%20renunciation%20of%0Athe%20right%20to%20go%20West%20as%20an%20argument.%20%20Her%20renunciation%20and%0Asuffering%20were%20related%20to%20and%20enmeshed%20with%20Frodo%27s%3B%20both%0Awere%20parts%20of%20a%20plan%20for%20the%20regeneration%20of%20the%20state%20of%0AMen.%20%20Her%20prayer%20might%20therefore%20be%20specially%20effective%2C%0Aand%20her%20plan%20have%20a%20certain%20equity%20of%20exchange.%20%20No%20doubt%0Ait%20was%20Gandalf%20who%20was%20the%20authority%20that%20accepted%20her%0Aplea.%22%0AJRRT%2C%20Letters%20%23246%0A%0A%0A
Hasdrubal%20Hamilcar%20%41nospam@nospam.net-nospam%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3CpFhOa.72644$41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A%0A%0AYes%2C%20but%20you%20can%27t%20refine%20ore%20you%20do%20not%20have.%20%20You%20GET%20the%20ore%20by...%0Amining.%20%20I%20mentioned%20metalworking%20%28of%20which%20refining%20is%20a%20component%20%2F%0Apre-requisite%29%20in%20addition%20to%20the%20mining%20which%20HAD%20been%20under%0Adiscussion%20precisely%20because%20%27slag%27%20is%20not%20generated%20during%20the%20mining%0Aprocess.%20%20However%2C%20the%20industries%20are%20all%20inter-related%20and%20capable%20of%0Acontributing%20to%20the%20kind%20of%20%27poisoned%20landscape%27%20described.%0A%0A%0AYet%20that%20does%20not%20seem%20to%20be%20the%20case%20here.%20%20There%20were%20no%20%27factories%27%0Aor%20other%20industry%20mentioned%20in%20the%20area...%20it%20wouldn%27t%20make%20much%20sense%0Ato%20build%20them%20OUTSIDE%20of%20Mordor.%20%20Further%2C%20we%20know%20that%20Sauron%20DID%0Ahave%20such%20things%20at%20Barad-dur%20and%20Amon%20Amarth.%20%20As%20such%20I%20think%20the%0Aimplication%20is%20that%20the%20slag%20and%20other%20waste%20was%20produced%20within%0AMordor%20and%20dumped%20outside.%0A%0A%0A
Hello%20all%2C%0A%0AI%20bought%20a%20CD%20version%20of%20the%20Rob%20Inglis%20%28speaker%29%20unabbriged%20%22The%0AHobbit%22%20audiobook.%20However%20the%20first%20%28about%29%20two%20pages%20of%20Chapter%20IX%0A%22Barrels%20out%20of%20Bond%22%20seem%20to%20be%20missing.%20The%20should%20be%20on%20CD%20no.%206%20%28of%0A10%29%2C%20Track%208%20--%20but%20that%20starts%20at%20%22Long%20and%20searchingly%20he%20questioned%0Athe%20dwarves...%22%20while%20Track%207%20was%20the%20end%20of%20Chapter%20VIII%20%22Flies%20and%0ASpiders%22%21%0A%0AThis%20Edition%20came%20in%20two%20cases%20of%205%20CDs%20each%3B%20on%20each%20CD%20it%20says:%0A%0A%22THE%20HOBBIT%20%2F%20J.R.R.%20TOLKIEN%20%2F%20READ%20BY%20ROB%20INGLIS%20%2F%20CD%20%3Csome%20number%3E%20%2F%0AHarperCollinsAudioBooks%20%2F%20THE%20HOBBIT%20%28C%29%20....%20%2F%20This%20digitally%0Aremastered%20edition%20published%20by%20HarperCollins%20Publishers%20Ltd%2C%20London%2C%20UK%0A2002%20%2F%20HCCD%20880%22.%0A%0AThe%20CD%236%20has%20a%20noticably%20shorter%20playing%20time%20than%20the%20others%20in%20the%0Aset%2C%20also%20it%20is%20the%20only%20one%20with%20just%2014%20Tracks%20on%20it.%20An%20inlay%20does%0Agive%20the%20track%20lengths%20as%20they%20are%20on%20the%20disk%20though.%0A%0AMy%20question:%20Is%20this%20a%20well-known%20screw%20up%3F%20Is%20any%20more%20of%20the%20text%0Amissing%20in%20this%20edition%20%28I%20didn%27t%20listen%20to%20all%20of%20it%20yet%29%3F%20Has%20anybody%0Ahad%20success%20with%20getting%20a%20corrected%20CD%20from%20the%20Publisher%3F%0A%0A--%0A%0ALinards%20Ticmanis%0A%0A%20The%20Master%20said%2C%20%22The%20business%20of%20laying%20on%20the%20colors%20follows%20the%0Apreparation%20of%20the%20plain%20ground.%22%0A%0A%0A%0A
Hello%20everybody%21%20%20%5E_%5E%0A%0AI%27ve%20got%20a%20question%20concerning%20the%20stars%20and%20star%20constellations:%0A%0AIn%20the%20chapter%20%22Of%20the%20coming%20of%20the%20Elves%22%20Varda%20...%0A%0A%22...%20took%20the%20silver%20dews%20from%20the%20vats%20of%20Telperion%2C%20and%20therewith%20she%20made%0Anew%20stars%20...%20.%20Carnil%20and%20Luinil%2C%20N%E9nar%20and%20Lumbar%2C%20Alcarinqu%EB%20and%20Elemm%EDr%EB%0Ashe%20wrought%20in%20that%20time%2C%20and%20many%20other%20of%20the%20ancient%20stars%20she%20gathered%0Atogether%20and%20set%20signs%20in%20the%20heavens%20of%20Arda:%20Wilwarin%2C%20Telumendil%2C%20Soron%FAm%EB%2C%0Aand%20Anarr%EDma%3B%20and%20Menelmacar%20...%20.%20And%20high%20in%20the%20north%20...%20she%20set%20the%20crown%0Aof%20seven%20mighty%20stars%20to%20swing%2C%20Valacirca%20...%20.%22%0A%0AAccording%20to%20the%20Silmarillion%20index%20Wilwarin%20was%20perhaps%20the%20constellation%0ACassiopeia%2C%20Menelmacar%20the%20Orion%20and%20Valacirca%20the%20Great%20Bear.%20Does%20anyone%20know%0Aif%20any%20of%20the%20other%20stars%20and%20constellations%20have%20been%20identified%3F%20Could%20the%0Ared%20shining%20star%20Carnil%20be%20for%20instance%20the%20planet%20Mars%20that%20is%20often%20referred%0Ato%20as%20the%20Red%20Planet%3F%0A%0A%0AChristine%0A%0A%0A
Here%27s%20the%20solution%20in%20full%3B%20I%20did%20not%20peek%20at%20the%20author%27s%20website%20for%20his%20or%0Aher%20solution:%0A%0AProblem:%20%20There%20are%20twelve%20balls%2C%20eleven%20of%20which%20are%20exactly%20the%20same%20weight%2C%0Aand%20one%20odd%20ball%20out%20of%20almost%20but%20not%20quite%20exactly%20the%20same%20weight%20as%20the%0Aother%20eleven.%20%20With%203%20uses%20of%20the%20balance%2C%20determine%20the%20odd%20ball%20out%20and%20if%20it%0Ais%20lighter%20or%20heavier%20than%20the%20others.%0A%0AAlgorithm:%20%20%5Bit%20is%20complicated%20but%20easy%20to%20understand%5D%0A%0A1.%20%20Divide%20the%2012%20at%20random%20into%203%20sets%20of%20four.%0A%0A2.%20%20Weigh%20any%20two%20sets%20against%20each%20other%2C%20and%20temporarily%20call%20them%20the%20left%2C%0Athe%20right%2C%20and%20the%20balls-in-hand.%0A%0A3.%20%20If%20the%20two%20sets%20balance%2C%20ie%20neither%20is%20heavier%20than%20the%20other%20label%20all%208%0Aon%20the%20balance%20as%20similar%2C%20or%20%22s%22%20balls%2C%20and%20the%20other%204%20as%20%22%3F%22%20balls.%20%20Then%0Afollow%20steps%204%20and%20on.%20%20If%20the%20two%20sets%20are%20imbalanced%2C%20label%20the%20heavy%20side%20as%0A%22h%22%20balls%20and%20the%20light%20side%20as%20%22L%22%20balls%2C%20and%20the%20balls-in-hand%20as%20%22s%22%20balls.%0AThen%20follow%20steps%208%20and%20on.%0A%0A4.%20%20Take%203%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%203%20%22%3F%22%20balls%20onto%20the%20balance.%20%20If%20they%20balance%20then%0Arelabel%20the%203%20%22%3F%22%20balls%20as%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%20continue%20on%20to%20step%205.%20%20If%20they%20are%0Aimbalanced%20then%20label%20the%20remaining%20%22%3F%22%20ball%20as%20an%20%22s%22%20ball%20and%20continue%20on%0Afrom%20step%206.%0A%0A5.%20%20You%20now%20have%2011%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%20one%20%22%3F%22%20ball.%20%20The%20final%20balance%20attempt%0Aweighs%20an%20%22s%22%20ball%20against%20the%20%22%3F%22%20ball%2C%20and%20from%20this%20you%20can%20determine%20if%20it%0Ais%20light%20or%20heavy.%20%20END%0A%0A6.%20%20You%20now%20have%209%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%203%20%22%3F%22%20balls%2C%20and%20from%20step%204%20if%20the%203%20%22%3F%22%20are%0Alighter%20than%20the%203%20%22s%22%20balls%20weighed%20against%2C%20then%20relabel%20the%203%20%22%3F%22%20balls%20to%0A%22L%22%20balls.%20%20Otherwise%2C%20label%20the%203%20%22%3F%22%20balls%20to%20%22h%22%20balls.%20%20You%20know%20if%20the%0Aoddball%20is%20light%20or%20heavy%20now.%0A%0A7.%20%20Weigh%20one%20of%20these%203%20balls%20against%20another%20one%20of%20the%203%20balls.%20%20If%20they%20are%0Athe%20same%2C%20then%20the%20ball%20not%20weighed%20is%20the%20oddball%20and%20it%20is%20heavy%20or%20light%0Afrom%20step%206.%20%20If%20they%20are%20imbalanced%2C%20then%20from%20step%206%20choose%20the%20oddball%0Abecause%20it%20is%20either%20a%20%22heavy%22%20ball%20and%20heavier%20than%20the%20other%20ball%2C%20or%20a%0A%22light%22%20ball%20and%20lighter%20than%20the%20other%20ball.%20%20END%0A%0A8.%20%20From%20the%20first%20weighing%2C%20you%20now%20have%204%20%22h%22%20balls%2C%204%20%22L%22%20balls%2C%20because%20one%0Aset%20of%20four%20was%20found%20to%20be%20lighter%20or%20heavier%20than%20the%20other%20set%20of%204.%20%20The%204%0Anot%20weighed%20must%20then%20be%20%22s%22%20balls%2C%20because%20there%20is%20only%20one%20oddball%20and%20it%20is%0Aamong%20the%208%20weighed%20already.%20%20Label%20accordingly.%0A%0A9.%20%20Take%202%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%202%20%22h%22%20balls%20and%20weigh%20against%20the%202%20other%20%22h%22%20balls%0Aand%202%20%22L%22%20balls.%20%20On%20the%20side%2C%20you%20have%202%20%22L%22%20balls%20and%20the%20other%202%20%22s%22%20balls.%0AIf%20they%20balance%2C%20then%20continue%20on%20from%20step%2010.%20%20If%20not%2C%20then%20continue%20on%20from%0Astep%2012.%0A%0A10.%20%20Sets%20that%20balance%20are%20automatically%20%22s%22%20balls%2C%20so%20relabel%20the%204%20%22h%22%20balls%0Aas%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%20the%202%20%22L%22%20balls%20as%20%22s%22%20balls.%20%20What%20is%20left%20is%202%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%0A2%20%22L%22%20balls%20on%20the%20side%2C%20which%20means%20the%20oddball%20is%20one%20of%20the%202%20%22L%22%20balls.%20%20It%0Ais%20light%2C%20because%20of%20the%20first%20weighing%2C%20where%20the%20lightness%20of%20the%20oddball%0Acaused%20that%20set%20to%20be%20less%20heavy%20than%20the%20other%20set%20in%20the%20first%20weighing.%0A%0A11.%20%20Weigh%20one%20%22L%22%20ball%20against%20the%20other%2C%20and%20the%20lighter%20one%20is%20the%20oddball%0Aand%20it%20is%20light.%20%20END%0A%0A12.%20%20If%20the%202%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%20the%202%20%22h%22%20balls%20weigh%20less%20than%20the%202%20%22h%22%20balls%20and%0Athe%202%20%22L%22%20balls%2C%20the%20balls%20on%20the%20side%20become%20%22s%22%20balls.%20%20Continue%20on%20to%20step%0A13%2C%20otherwise%20continue%20on%20to%20step%2014%2C%20where%20the%202%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%20the%202%20%22h%22%20balls%0Aweigh%20more%20than%20the%202%20%22h%22%20balls%20and%20the%202%20%22L%22%20balls.%0A%0A13.%20%20A%20little%20thinking%20will%20tell%20you%20that%202s%20+%202h%20are%20really%204%20%22s%22%20balls%0Abecause%20the%20%22h%22%20balls%20cannot%20be%20lighter%20than%20any%20of%20the%20other%20balls.%0ASimilarly%2C%20the%202%20%22L%22%20balls%20on%20the%20heavy%20side%20of%20this%20weighing%20cannot%20be%20heavier%0Athan%20any%20of%20the%20other%20balls%2C%20so%20they%20must%20also%20be%20%22s%22%20balls.%20%20That%20leaves%202%20%22h%22%0Aballs%20on%20the%20heavy%20side%20of%20this%20weighing.%20Weigh%20these%20two%20against%20each%20other%0Aand%20the%20heavier%20is%20the%20oddball%20out.%20%20END%0A%0A14.%20%20Again%2C%20the%204%20balls%20on%20the%20side%20during%20the%20second%20weighing%20are%20all%20%22s%22%0Aballs.%20%20It%20is%20tricky%20here%20because%20either%20the%202%20%22h%22%20balls%20from%20the%202s2h%20combo%0Aare%20heavy%2C%20or%20the%202%20%22L%22%20balls%20from%20the%202h2L%20combo%20are%20light.%20%20Therefore%2C%20the%202%0A%22h%22%20balls%20from%20the%202h2L%20combo%20should%20be%20relabeled%20as%20%22s%22%20balls.%0A%0A15.%20%20Take%201%20%22h%22%20ball%20and%201%20%22L%22%20ball%20and%20weigh%20against%20the%20other%20%22L%22%20ball%20and%201%0A%22s%22%20ball.%20%20On%20the%20side%20you%20only%20have%20the%20other%20%22h%22%20ball.%20%20If%20this%20attempt%20is%0Abalanced%20%5Bif%20not%2C%20continue%20on%20to%20step%2016%5D%2C%20all%204%20of%20the%20balls%20on%20the%20balance%0Abecome%20%22s%22%20balls%20and%20the%20%22h%22%20ball%20on%20the%20side%20is%20the%20oddball%20and%20it%20can%20only%20be%0Aheavy.%20%20END%0A%0A16.%20%20If%20the%201h1L%20combo%20is%20lighter%20than%20the%201L1s%20combo%20%5Bcontinue%20on%20to%20step%2017%0Aif%20it%20is%20not%5D%20then%20because%20%22h%22%20balls%20cannot%20be%20lighter%20and%20%22L%22%20balls%20cannot%20be%0Aheavier%2C%20the%201h1L%20becomes%201s1L%20and%20it%20is%20lighter%20than%20the%201s1s%20combo.%0AEverything%20is%20an%20%22s%22%20ball%20except%20that%20one%20oddball%2C%20which%20is%20light.%20END%0A%0A17.%20%20The%201h1L%20combo%20is%20heavier%20than%20the%201L1s%20combo.%20%20Because%20%22h%22%20balls%20cannot%0Abe%20lighter%20and%20%22L%22%20balls%20cannot%20be%20heavier%2C%20the%20combo%20becomes%201h1s%20%3E%201L1s.%0AYou%27ve%20used%20your%20three%20weighings%2C%20and%20the%20oddball%20is%20either%20the%201%20%22h%22%20ball%20from%0Athe%201h1s%20combo%2C%20or%20the%201%20%22L%22%20ball%20from%20the%201L1s%20combo.%20%20What%20to%20do%3F%20%20Pick%20one%0Aas%20the%20oddball%2C%20either%20the%20light%20ball%20if%20you%20prefer%20light%2C%20or%20heavy%20ball%20if%20you%0Aprefer%20heavy%2C%20remembering%20that%20a%20heavy%20oddball%20cannot%20be%20light%2C%20and%20a%20light%0Aoddball%20cannot%20be%20heavy.%0A%0A18.%20%20If%20whoever%20you%20tell%20comes%20back%20to%20you%20and%20says%20you%27re%20correct%2C%20then%20you%0Aknow%20for%20sure%20which%20ball%20is%20the%20oddball.%20%20If%20that%20person%20tells%20you%20you%27re%0Aincorrect%2C%20then%20you%20know%20for%20sure%20which%20ball%20is%20the%20oddball.%20%20This%20is%20without%0Aresorting%20to%20any%20further%20weighings%20ON%20YOUR%20PART.%20%20THE%20END%0A%0A%0A%0A
Hi%21%0A%0AChocoholic%20schrieb:%0A%0A%0AMinas%20Ithil%2C%20Minas%20Anor%2C%20Osgiliath%20and%20Orthanc%20had%20AFAIR%20been%20built%20by%0AIsildur%20and%20Anarion.%20The%20ancient%20numenorian%20settlements%20had%20almost%0Aexclusively%20been%20near%20the%20coastlands.%0A%0A%5Bsnip%5D%0A%0A%0ANot%20the_same_%2C%20but%20even%20_more_.%20It%20is%20said%20that%20Gil-Galad%27s%20power%20spread%0Aout%20immensely%20in%20the%20North-West%20of%20ME%20during%20Sauron%27s%20exile%20on%20Numenor.%0A%0A%0AYet%20we%20must%20not%20forget%20that%20in%20the%20last%20period%20of%20this%20time%20the%0ANumenorians%20became%20for%20the%20most%20part%20evil%20and%20hearkened%20ever%20more%20to%0ASauron%27s%20poisonous%20words%2C%20and%20that%20also%20heavily%20affected%20the%20settlers%20in%0AME.%20It%20is%20told%20that%20not%20few%20of%20the%20Numenorians%20remained%20black%20in%20their%0Ahearts%20even%20after%20the%20destruction%20of%20Numenor%20and%20the%20arrival%20of%20the%0AFaithful.%0AOne%20could%20guess%20that%20those%20currupted%20Numenorians%20had%20done%20nothing%20but%0Aexecuting%20Sauron%27s%20will%2C%20even%20though%20the%20command%20had%20come%20from%0AAr-Pharazon.%20So%20it%20might%20be%20that%20Mordor%20had%20been%20untended%20in%20that%0Aperiod%2C%20yet%20Sauron%27s%20will%20had%20been%20present%20in%20ME.%0A%0A%0AHe%20had%20a%20good%20learning-curve%2C%20then.%20:-%29%0A%0A--%0ASo%20we%20made%20%27Wheel%20Of%20Fortune%27%0AAnd%20all%20the%20popular%20songs%0AWe%20made%20a%20land%20where%20crap%20is%20king%0AAnd%20the%20Good%20don%27t%20last%20too%20long%20%20%20%28SPOCK%27S%20BEARD%29%0A%0A%0A%0A
Hi%21%0A%0ARobert%20J.%20Kolker%20schrieb:%0A%0A%0AThat%27s%20IMO%20indeed%20the%20best%20way%20to%20do%20it:%20Read%20LotR%20%28perhaps%20with%0Apreceeding%20%27The%20Hobbit%27%29%2C%20afterwards%20Sil%2C%20and%20then%20again%20LotR%20with%20a%20new%0Aperspective.%20But%20nobody%20should%20read%20Sil%20_before_%20LotR%2C%20even%20though%20this%0Aseems%20to%20make%20sense%20because%20of%20the%20chronological%20order.%0A%0A--%0ASo%20we%20made%20%27Wheel%20Of%20Fortune%27%0AAnd%20all%20the%20popular%20songs%0AWe%20made%20a%20land%20where%20crap%20is%20king%0AAnd%20the%20Good%20don%27t%20last%20too%20long%20%20%20%28SPOCK%27S%20BEARD%29%0A%0A%0A%0A
Hi%2C%0A%0AI%27m%20sure%20I%20read%20somewhere%20that%20Tolkien%20went%20to%20some%20effort%20to%0A%22absolve%22%20Galadriel%20from%20her%20part%20in%20the%20crimes%20of%20Feanor%2C%20but%20I%20can%0Afind%20no%20suggestion%20in%20the%20Silm%20that%20she%20actively%20participated%20in%20any%0Aof%20his%20numerous%20misdeeds.%20Which%20half%20of%20this%20equation%20am%20I%20getting%0Awrong%3F%0A%0A%0A
Hiemalis%20said:%0A%0A%7Bsnip%7D%0A%0AThere%27s%20a%20very%20good%20site%20about%20that%20topic%20here:%0A%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fusers.cybercity.dk%2F~bkb1782%2Ftolkien%2Fstarsframe.html%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%22The%20narrative%20ends%20here.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20There%20is%20no%20reason%20to%20think%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%2F%2F%0A%28%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20that%20any%20more%20was%20ever%20written.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%2F%2F%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20The%20manuscript%2C%20which%20becomes%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20increasingly%20rapid%20towards%20the%20end%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%0A%28%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20peters%20out%20in%20a%20scrawl.%22%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%7C%0A%7C%7C%20%20%20%20%20-Christopher%20Tolkien%2C%20_The%20Lost%20Road_%20%20%2F%2F%20%7C%7C%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
How%20Rude%21%21%21%20%20%20I%20must%20be%20chastised%21%0AWait%20a%20minute%2C%20I%27m%20replying%20to%20myself%21%21%21%0ANo%2C%20I%20am%21%0AYes%2C%20I%27m%20not%21%0AShut-up%21%0ANo%2C%20you%20shut-up%21%0AYes%2C%20I%20won%27t...%0A%0AOn%20Sun%2C%2020%20Jul%202003%2010:57:07%20-0500%2C%41nospam@nospam.net%20wrote:%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A-----=%20Posted%20via%20Newsfeeds.Com%2C%20Uncensored%20Usenet%20News%20=-----%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fwww.newsfeeds.com%20-%20The%20%231%20Newsgroup%20Service%20in%20the%20World%21%0A-----==%20%20Over%2080%2C000%20Newsgroups%20-%2016%20Different%20Servers%21%20=-----%0A%0A%0A
I%20had%20written:%0A%0A%0AIn%20response%20to%20which%20Tar-Elenion%20provided%20the%20following%20quote%20from%20%22The%20Road%0AGoes%20Ever%20On%22%0A%0A%3Csnip%3E%0A%0A%3Csnip%3E%0A%0A%0AThanks%20for%20the%20quote.%20%20It%20is%20a%20good%20one.%20%20And%2C%20unlike%20much%20of%20what%20people%20like%0Ato%20throw%20around%20on%20this%20NG%2C%20it%20is%20something%20Tolkien%20actually%20published.%0A%0AHowever...%0A%0AAs%20in%20LOTR%2C%20he%20fails%20to%20go%20into%20detail%20as%20to%20the%20nature%20of%20her%20rebellion.%0AUnless%20his%20later%20writings%20suggest%20that%20she%20did%20not%20disobey%20or%20defy%20the%20the%0AValar%20at%20all%2C%20I%20do%20not%20see%20how%20one%20can%20claim%20a%20contradiction.%0A%0AFurthermore%2C%20even%20if%20these%20later%20scribbles%20do%20contradict%20his%20published%20work%2C%0Areaders%20still%20have%20no%20cause%20for%20complaint%20%28or%20to%20compare%20Tolkien%20to%20Lucas%29%0Abecause%20Tolkien%20never%20released%20this%20Special%20Edition%20of%20Galadriel%27s%20rebellion%20to%0Athe%20public.%0A%0AIt%20seems%20to%20me%20that%20those%20who%20delve%20too%20deep%20into%20an%20author%27s%20private%0Ascribbles%2C%20and%20are%20disappointed%20by%20what%20they%20find%2C%20have%20only%20themselve%20%28and%0AChris%20Tolkien%29%20to%20blame.%20%20Why%20should%20it%20surprise%20anyone%20that%20Tolkien%27s%0Apublished%20work%20should%20be%20better%20than%20his%20unpublished%20scribble-notes%3F%0ARegardless%20of%20whether%20such%20notes%20were%20written%20earlier%20or%20later%2C%20why%20should%20it%0Asurprise%20the%20investigator%20to%20find%20things%20among%20them%20that%20are%20carelessly%0Awritten%2C%20ill-considered%2C%20and%20contradictory%3F%0A%0A-%20John%20Whelan%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
I%20have%20one.%0AGlass.%20%20Of%20course.%0AHas%20Gandalf%20on%20it.%0ABase%20has%20a%20red%20LED%20that%20can%20be%0Aturned%20on%20and%20off.%0A%0ACheese%20factor%207%20out%20of%2010%0A%0A%0A%0A--%0AGandalfSC%0A--%0AScanned%20by%20Norton%20Anti-Virus%0AAnd%20deemed%20herewith%20Virus%20Free%0A%0A%22T.%20Nguyen%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%0Anews:41nospam@nospam.net...%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fcgi.ebay.com%2Fws%2FeBayISAPI.dll%3FViewItem&item=2185266395&category=29799&rd=1%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
I%20seem%20to%20remember%20that%20on%20viewing%20some%20Angles%20Saint%20Augustine%0Aremarked%20that%20they%20should%20be%20called%20%22angels%22%20because%20of%20their%20golden%0Ahair.%20%20That%20as%20got%20to%20be%20true%20...%20I%20read%20it%20somewhere.%20%20The%20angels%20in%0Amy%20Christmas%20ornaments%20seem%20to%20bear%20out%20this%20description.%0A%0AHowever%20I%20also%20heard%20that%20cherubs%20used%20to%20be%20fearsome%20creatures%2C%20part%0Alion%20and%20part%20eagle%20with%20a%20human%20head%2C%20rather%20than%20the%20cubby%20children%0Awe%20see%20on%20Valentine%27s%20day.%20%20Perhaps%20some%20of%20them%20were%20bald%3F%0A%0A-Terry%0A%0A%0A%0A%22Robert%20J.%20Kolker%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%3Cn_QVa.19852$o%252.10359@sccrnsc02%3E...%0A%0A%0A
I%27ve%20always%20wondered%20what%20goes%20on%20around%20the%20edges%20of%20JRRT%27s%20maps%2C%20too.%0A%0A%22Furio97%22%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%0Anews:41nospam@nospam.net...%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
ISTR%20reading%20that%20the%20guns%20on%20the%20first%20day%20of%20the%20Battle%20of%20the%20Somme%20%28one%0Aof%20the%20WWI%20battles%2C%20anyway%29%20could%20be%20heard%20clearly%20on%20Hampstead%20Heath%2C%0Agetting%20on%20for%20200%20miles%20away.%20%20%28I%20don%27t%20know%20if%20this%20is%20true%20or%20just%20an%0Aurban%20myth%2C%20though%29.%0A%0AAndrew%0A--%0AAndrew%20Wells%0AReplace%20nospam%20with%20my%20first%20name%20to%20reach%20me%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
In%20The%20Road%20Goes%20Ever%20On%20-%20A%20Song%20Cycle%2C%20music%20by%20Donald%20Swann%2C%20Poems%0Aby%20Tolkien%2C%20there%20is%20a%20section%20entitled%20Notes%20and%20Translations.%20Below%0Athis%20it%20states%20%22Here%20follow%20Professor%20Tolkien%27s%20scripts%2C%20translations%0Aand%20comments%20on%20the%20Elvish%20texts%20for%20%27Namarie%27%28song%20Number%205%29%20and%20%27A%0AElbereth%20Gilthoniel%27%20%28in%20song%20Number%206%29.%22%0A%0AMy%20question%20is%20whether%20others%20consider%20these%20comments%20canonical%20or%0Anot.%20I%20believe%20the%20work%20was%20published%20in%201967.%0A%0AThanks%20for%20your%20thoughts.%0A%0ACharlie%0A%0A%0A
In%20alt.fan.tolkien%20John%20Brock%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A:%20In%20article%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%2C%20Louis%20Epstein%20%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0A:%3EIn%20alt.fan.tolkien%20Michael%20Harper%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0A:%3E:%20%22Louis%20Epstein%22%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:41nospam@nospam.net...%0A%0A:%3E:%3E%20I%20of%20course%20note%20with%20great%20delight%20that%20the%20film%20FINDING%20NEMO%0A:%3E:%3E%20has%20knocked%20the%20first%20Jackson%20flick%20down%20a%20notch%20on%20the%20all-time%0A:%3E:%3E%20domestic%20gross%20charts%2Ccontinues%20to%20close%20the%20gap%20on%20the%20second%2C%0A:%3E:%3E%20and%20is%20doing%20its%20best%20to%20make%20it%20difficult%20for%20the%20third%20to%20be%0A:%3E:%3E%20the%20top%20grosser%20of%202003.%0A:%3E:%3E%0A:%3E:%3E%20PJ%27s%20second%20effort%20is%20now%20at%20the%20very%20end%20of%20its%20run%2CI%20don%27t%0A:%3E:%3E%20know%20if%20any%20of%20the%2032%20remaining%20theaters%20will%20keep%20it%20after%20tomorrow.%0A:%3E:%3E%20After%20two%20months%20in%20release%20Nemo%20has%20only%20just%20started%20grossing%0A:%3E:%3E%20under%20a%20million%20dollars%20on%20weekdays...at%20this%20point%20PJ%27s%20first%20was%0A:%3E:%3E%20in%20the%20$300K%20range%20and%20his%20second%20in%20the%20$200K%20range.%0A%0A:%3E:%20I%20couldn%27t%20give%20a%20rats%20if%20another%20movie%20has%20over%20taken%20LOTR%2C%20I%20do%20not%20judge%0A:%3E:%20a%20film%20by%20how%20much%20cash%20it%20makes%20%28Though%20i%20think%20Return%20of%20the%20King%20will%20be%0A:%3E:%20a%20good%20bit%20higher%20than%20the%20first%20two%29%0A:%3E:%20Also%20i%20do%20not%20see%20the%20need%20in%20you%20pouncing%20on%20any%20tiny%20thing%20that%20%2Aknocks%2A%0A:%3E:%20PJ%20or%20the%20movies%20in%20any%20way%2C%20you%20clearly%20dislike%20the%20movie%20versions%20and%20that%0A:%3E:%20is%20fair%20enough%2C%20i%20just%20feel%20the%20majority%20of%20us%20already%20know%20this%20by%20now.%0A%0A:%3EI%20find%20every%20commercial%20or%20critical%20overtaking%20or%20defeat%0A:%3Eof%20any%20attempt%20to%20do%20the%20unforgivable%20and%20adapt%20the%20peerless%0A:%3EArda%20canon%20to%20film%2Cwhich%20it%20is%20too%20good%20for%2Cto%20be%20cause%20for%0A:%3Ecelebration.%0A:%3E%0A:%3EAny%20film%20that%20passes%20any%20of%20PJ%27s%20efforts%20in%20box%20office%2C%0A:%3EI%20will%20congratulate.Any%20Best%20Picture%20etc.%20winner%20that%0A:%3Eisn%27t%20a%20PJ%20effort%20I%20will%20congratulate.%0A%0A:%20OK%20Louis%2C%20you%27ve%20explained%20why%20you%20care.%20%20Now%20can%20you%20explain%20why%0A:%20anyone%20else%20should%20care%3F%20%20Both%20LOTR%20movies%20have%20been%20%2Aextremely%2A%0A:%20successful.%0A%0AFar%20more%20so%20than%20they%20deserve.%0AMore%20reason%20to%20celebrate%20when%20they%20are%20outstripped.%0A%0A:%20Are%20you%20expecting%20anyone%20here%20to%20be%20upset%20or%20dismayed%0A:%20because%20Finding%20Nemo%20has%20also%20done%20well%3F%0A%0AI%27d%20prefer%20that%20people%20here%20share%20my%20pleasure.%0A%0A:%20Are%20you%20expecting%20anyone%0A:%20to%20change%20their%20opinion%20of%20the%20films%20based%20on%20this%20fact%3F%20%20Are%20you%0A:%20expecting%20anyone%20to%20be%20interested%20in%20the%20fact%20that%20you%20are%20ONCE%0A:%20AGAIN%20gloating%20that%20some%20movie%20has%20done%20well%20with%20respect%20to%20the%0A:%20LOTR%20movies%3F%20%20What%3F%0A%0AI%20would%20rather%20that%20you%20learn%20to%20gloat%20with%20me.%0A%0A:%3E:%3E%20NO%20MAN%20%28OR%20WOMAN%29%20COMETH%20TO%20MIDDLE-EARTH%20BUT%20THROUGH%20THE%20BOOKS%21%0A%0A:%20Why%20do%20you%20keep%20saying%20this%3F%3F%3F%20%20Do%20you%20have%20any%20idea%20how%20%2Abad%2A%20it%0A:%20makes%20you%20look%3F%0A%0ADo%20you%20have%20no%20idea%20how%20bad%20it%20makes%20YOU%20look%20to%20disagree%3F%0A%0A%0A:%20Especially%20when%20the%20reader%20comes%20to%20realize%20that%20you%20aren%27t%20joking%0A:%20or%20being%20ironic%21%20%20I%20read%20this%20sentence%20and%20think%20%22deranged%20fanboy%22.%0A:%20Do%20you%20honestly%20think%20a%20single%20person%20reading%20one%20of%20your%20posts%20has%0A:%20ever%20read%20that%20sentence%20without%20having%20a%20similar%20thought%3F%0A%0AThe%20mark%20of%20a%20deranged%20fanboy%20is%20to%20adore%20the%20films.%0A%0A-=-=-%0AThe%20World%20Trade%20Center%20towers%20MUST%20rise%20again%2C%0Aat%20least%20as%20tall%20as%20before...or%20terror%20has%20triumphed.%0A%0A%0A
In%20alt.fan.tolkien%20Ronald%20O.%20Christian%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A:%20On%20Wed%2C%2030%20Jul%202003%2016:59:37%20-0500%2C%20Louis%20Epstein%0A:%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A:%3EAny%20film%20that%20passes%20any%20of%20PJ%27s%20efforts%20in%20box%20office%2C%0A:%3EI%20will%20congratulate.Any%20Best%20Picture%20etc.%20winner%20that%0A:%3Eisn%27t%20a%20PJ%20effort%20I%20will%20congratulate.%0A%0A:%20Oh%2C%20you%20say%20that%20now%2C%20but%20just%20wait%20until%20John%20Boorman%27s%20%22The%20Hobbit%22%0A:%20hits%20the%20screens...%0A%0AThat%20would%20be%20a%20changed%20situation%20with%20a%20new%20enemy.%0A%0A-=-=-%0AThe%20World%20Trade%20Center%20towers%20MUST%20rise%20again%2C%0Aat%20least%20as%20tall%20as%20before...or%20terror%20has%20triumphed.%0A%0A%0A
In%20alt.fan.tolkien%20SiFi%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A:%20Louis%20Epstein%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news:%41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A:%3E%20I%20of%20course%20note%20with%20great%20delight%20that%20the%20film%20FINDING%20NEMO%0A:%3E%20has%20knocked%20the%20first%20Jackson%20flick%20down%20a%20notch%20on%20the%20all-time%0A:%3E%20domestic%20gross%20charts%2Ccontinues%20to%20close%20the%20gap%20on%20the%20second%2C%0A:%3E%20and%20is%20doing%20its%20best%20to%20make%20it%20difficult%20for%20the%20third%20to%20be%0A:%3E%20the%20top%20grosser%20of%202003.%0A%0A:%20I%20note%20with%20great%20delight%20that%20in%20the%20WORLDWIDE%20all-time%20gross%20charts%2C%0A:%20The%20Fellowship%20of%20the%20Ring%20is%20still%20sitting%20at%20%237%20and%20The%20Two%20Towers%0A:%20is%20%235.%20Nemo%20is%20currently%20at%20%2374%2C%20but%20will%20no%20doubt%20rise%20higher%20as%20it%0A:%20is%20released%20in%20other%20countries.%20And%20good%20on%20it%2C%20I%20hear%20it%27s%20a%20great%0A:%20movie.%0A%0A:%3E%20NO%20MAN%20%28OR%20WOMAN%29%20COMETH%20TO%20MIDDLE-EARTH%20BUT%20THROUGH%20THE%20BOOKS%21%0A%0A:%20Too%20late%20for%20that%3B%20there%20are%20thousands...maybe%20even%20millions...of%0A:%20people%20out%20there%20who%20will%20see%20the%20movies%20and%20never%20read%20the%20books.%0A%0AUmm...the%20point%20is%2Cthat%20any%20claim%20that%20they%20have%20validly%0A%22come%20to%20Middle-Earth%22%20is%20false%20and%20to%20be%20denounced.%0A%0A:%20Whatever%20will%20we%20do%3F%0A%0AAlternately%20fume%20and%20gloat%20as%20appropriate.%0A%0A:%20Maybe......get%20over%20it%3F%3F%20:-%29%0A%0A%5Bshaking%20head%20in%20shock%20at%20the%20suggestion%5D%0A%0A-=-=-%0AThe%20World%20Trade%20Center%20towers%20MUST%20rise%20again%2C%0Aat%20least%20as%20tall%20as%20before...or%20terror%20has%20triumphed.%0A%0A%0A
In%20alt.fan.tolkien%20Yuk%20Tang%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A:%20Louis%20Epstein%20wrote:%0A:%3E%0A:%3E%20I%20find%20every%20commercial%20or%20critical%20overtaking%20or%20defeat%0A:%3E%20of%20any%20attempt%20to%20do%20the%20unforgivable%20and%20adapt%20the%20peerless%0A:%3E%20Arda%20canon%20to%20film%2Cwhich%20it%20is%20too%20good%20for%2Cto%20be%20cause%20for%0A:%3E%20celebration.%0A%0A:%20I%27ve%20asked%20you%20before%2C%20without%20receiving%20an%20answer.%20%20I%27m%20hoping%20that%20you%27ll%0A:%20grace%20me%20with%20a%20reply%20this%20time.%0A%0A:%20Which%20version%20of%20LotR%20and%20The%20Hobbit%20do%20you%20consider%20to%20be%20canon%3F%20%20Would%20you%0A:%20celebrate%20if%20all%20other%20versions%20of%20the%20text%20were%20burned%3F%0A%0A:%20Cheers%2C%20ymt.%0A%0AI%20don%27t%20think%20a%20totally%20typo-free%20edition%20has%20emerged%20yet.%0A%0A-=-=-%0AThe%20World%20Trade%20Center%20towers%20MUST%20rise%20again%2C%0Aat%20least%20as%20tall%20as%20before...or%20terror%20has%20triumphed.%0A%0A%0A
