In%20article%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%2C%0A%41nospam@nospam.net%20%28rjc2001%29%20wrote:%0A%0A%0A%20%20%20%20%20The%20AICN%20review%20did%20say%20that%20Faramir%27s%20additional%20scenes%20should%0Aappease%20the%20Faramir-lovers%20to%20some%20degree%2C%20by%20showing%20additional%20facets%0Aof%20his%20personality.%20%20I%27m%20hoping%20that%20some%20combination%20of%20the%20additional%0Amaterial%2C%20Jackson%27s%20commentary%2C%20and%20the%20events%20of%20RotK%20will%20serve%20to%0Aexplain%20the%20otherwise%20inexplicable%20changes%20to%20Faramir%20in%20the%20theatrical%0Aversion.%20%20Certainly%2C%20for%20RotK%20to%20work%20Faramir%20has%20to%20be%20more%20than%20what%0Awe%20saw%20in%20TTT.%0A%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20----j7y%0A%0A--%0A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%2A%0Ajere7my%20tho%3Frpe%20%2F%20800-555-1212%20%20%20%20%20%20%22There%20is%20no%20spoon.%22%20%20%22SPOON%21%22%20%20%22There%0A%20%20%20%20%3E%3E%3E%20%41nospam@nospam.net%20%20%3C%3C%3C%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20is%20no%20spoon.%22%20%20%22SPOON%21%22%20%20%22There%20is%20no%0Ainvert%20liws%20to%20reply%20via%20email%20%20%20%20%20%20%20spoon.%22%20%20%22SPOON%21%22%20--%20The%20Tick%20vs.%20Neo%0A%0A%0A
In%20article%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%2C%41nospam@nospam.net%20says...%0A%0AThe%20problem%20between%20this%20and%20some%20of%20the%20later%20writings%20on%20the%20subject%20is%0Athat%20in%20RGEO%20Galadriel%20is%20stated%20to%20be%20a%20leader%20in%20the%20rebellion.%20In%20the%0Alast%20version%20%28see%20UT%2C%20History%20of%20G&C%3B%20and%20also%20Letter%20353%29%20she%20is%20removed%0Afrom%20any%20association%20with%20the%20rebellion%20and%20she%20and%20Celeborn%20depart%20from%0AAman%20seperately%20from%20the%20Exiles%20%28thus%20she%20could%20not%20be%20one%20of%20those%0A%22princes%20and%20queens%20who%20had%20led%20the%20revolting%20Noldor%20to%20exile%22.%0AIt%20does%20not%20contradict%20the%20Shibboleth%20account%20wherein%20she%20still%20joins%0Awith%20the%20rebellion%20and%20departs%20with%20the%20Exiles%20%28though%20how%20she%20ended%20up%0Aat%20Alqualonde%20before%20her%20kin%20could%20require%20some%20explanation%29.%20Celeborn%20as%0ATeleporno%20%28See%20UT%3B%20Shibboleth%3B%20Dwarves%20and%20Men%20%28endnote%207%29%3B%20and%20Letter%0A347%29%20does%20present%20problems%20%28other%20than%20RGEO%20stating%20he%20is%20a%20Sinda%29.%20%20Why%0Awould%20Teleporno%20join%20with%20the%20rebels%20who%20slaughtered%20his%20people%3F%20If%20he%0Aleaves%20seperately%20would%20he%20do%20so%20without%20Galadriel%3F%20Galadriel%20had%20reason%0Ato%20keep%20silent%20about%20the%20Kinslaying%2C%20but%20what%20reason%20would%20Teleporno%0Ahave%3F%0A%0A--%0ATar-Elenion%0A%0AExtremism%20in%20defense%20of%20liberty%20is%20no%20vice.%0AModeration%20in%20pursuit%20of%20justice%20is%20no%20virtue.%0A%0A%0A
