In%20article%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20in%0Arec.arts.books.tolkien%2C%20the%20softrat%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0AThere%20is%20indeed%20a%20Gandalf%2C%20though%20not%20under%20that%20name.%0A%0ABut%20if%20you%20think%20a%20sequel%20may%20not%20introduce%20characters%20and%20locations%0Athat%20were%20not%20in%20the%20original%2C%20you%20have%20a%20rather%20unusual%20idea%20of%20the%0Ameaning%20of%20the%20word.%0A%0AThere%20is%20also%20Tolkien%27s%20own%20statement%2C%20from%20Letter%20124%20%281950%29:%0A%22My%20work%20has%20escaped%20from%20my%20control%2C%20and%20I%20have%20produced%20a%20monster:%0Aan%20immensely%20long%2C%20complex%2C%20rather%20bitter%2C%20and%20very%20terrifying%0Aromance%2C%20quite%20unfit%20for%20children%20%28if%20fit%20for%20anybody%29%3B%20and%20it%20is%0Anot%20really%20a%20sequel%20to%20The%20Hobbit%2C%20but%20to%20The%20Silmarillion.%22%0A%0A--%0AStan%20Brown%2C%20Oak%20Road%20Systems%2C%20Cortland%20County%2C%20New%20York%2C%20USA%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20http:%2F%2FOakRoadSystems.com%0ATolkien%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2FTolkien.slimy.com%20%28Steuard%20Jensen%27s%20site%29%0ATolkien%20letters%20FAQ:%0A%20%20%20http:%2F%2Fusers.telerama.com%2F~taliesen%2Ftolkien%2Flettersfaq.html%0AFAQ%20of%20the%20Rings:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Fgenl%2Fringfaq.htm%0AEncyclopedia%20of%20Arda:%20http:%2F%2Fwww.glyphweb.com%2Farda%2Fdefault.htm%0Amore%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Ftech%2Ffaqget.htm%0A%0A%0A
In%20article%20%3C3f1bebe8$41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20in%20rec.arts.books.tolkien%2C%0AGonzalo%20Diethelm%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0AYes%2C%20the%20first%20edition%20of%20The%20Hobbit%20%281937%29%20had%20the%20original%20story.%0AI%20remember%20reading%20this%20as%20a%20child.%20The%20change%20was%20made%20in%201950.%0A%0A%2FThe%20Annotated%20Hobbit%2F%20has%20both%20versions.%20It%20is%20easier%20to%20read%20the%0Aold%20version%20as%20a%20connected%20chapter%20in%20the%20first%20edition%20of%20%2FTAH%2F%0Athan%20in%20the%20new%20second%20edition%2C%20if%20I%20recall%20correctly.%0A%0A--%0AStan%20Brown%2C%20Oak%20Road%20Systems%2C%20Cortland%20County%2C%20New%20York%2C%20USA%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20http:%2F%2FOakRoadSystems.com%0ATolkien%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2FTolkien.slimy.com%20%28Steuard%20Jensen%27s%20site%29%0ATolkien%20letters%20FAQ:%0A%20%20%20http:%2F%2Fusers.telerama.com%2F~taliesen%2Ftolkien%2Flettersfaq.html%0AFAQ%20of%20the%20Rings:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Fgenl%2Fringfaq.htm%0AEncyclopedia%20of%20Arda:%20http:%2F%2Fwww.glyphweb.com%2Farda%2Fdefault.htm%0Amore%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Ftech%2Ffaqget.htm%0A%0A%0A
In%20article%20%3C3f282770$0$12949$41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20in%0Arec.arts.books.tolkien%2C%20Matt%20McNabb%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0AAnd%20still%20you%20felt%20it%20would%20be%20a%20good%20idea%20to%20post%20it%20a%20second%20time%3F%0A%0AMoron.%0A%0A--%0AStan%20Brown%2C%20Oak%20Road%20Systems%2C%20Cortland%20County%2C%20New%20York%2C%20USA%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20http:%2F%2FOakRoadSystems.com%0ATolkien%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2FTolkien.slimy.com%20%28Steuard%20Jensen%27s%20site%29%0ATolkien%20letters%20FAQ:%0A%20%20%20http:%2F%2Fusers.telerama.com%2F~taliesen%2Ftolkien%2Flettersfaq.html%0AFAQ%20of%20the%20Rings:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Fgenl%2Fringfaq.htm%0AEncyclopedia%20of%20Arda:%20http:%2F%2Fwww.glyphweb.com%2Farda%2Fdefault.htm%0Amore%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Ftech%2Ffaqget.htm%0A%0A%0A
