In%20article%20%3Cbf10io$180$41nospam@nospam.net%3E%2C%41nospam@nospam.net%20says...%0A%0A%0A%0AThe%20phrase%20merely%20refers%20to%20the%20time%20of%20year%3B%20Mallorn-leaves%20fall%20in%0Aspring%20not%20autumn.%0A%22%20%60There%20lie%20the%20woods%20of%20Lothl%F3rien%21%27%20said%20Legolas.%20%60That%20is%20the%20fairest%0Aof%20all%20the%20dwellings%20of%20my%20people.%20There%20are%20no%20trees%20like%20the%20trees%20of%0Athat%20land.%20For%20in%20the%20autumn%20their%20leaves%20fall%20not%2C%20but%20turn%20to%20gold.%20Not%0Atill%20the%20spring%20comes%20and%20the%20new%20green%20opens%20do%20they%20fall%2C%20and%20then%20the%0Aboughs%20are%20laden%20with%20yellow%20flowers%3B%20and%20the%20floor%20of%20the%20wood%20is%0Agolden%2C%20and%20golden%20is%20the%20roof%2C%20and%20its%20pillars%20are%20of%20silver%2C%20for%20the%0Abark%20of%20the%20trees%20is%20smooth%20and%20grey.%27%22%0ALotR%2C%20FotR%2C%20Lothl%F3rien%0A%0A----%0ATar-Elenion%0A%0AExtremism%20in%20defense%20of%20liberty%20is%20no%20vice.%0AModeration%20in%20pursuit%20of%20justice%20is%20no%20virtue.%0A%0A%0A
