In%20article%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%2C%41nospam@nospam.net%20says...%0A%0AIn%20commentary%20on%20the%20song%20_Namarie_%20in%20published%20in%20%27The%20Road%20Goes%20Ever%0AOn%27%20%28and%20thus%20%27publicly%20released%27%20by%20JRRT%20in%20his%20lifetime%29%2C%20JRRT%20wrote:%0A%0A%22The%20question%20Si%20man%20i%20yulma%20nin%20enquantuva%3F%20and%20the%20question%20at%20the%20end%0Aof%20her%20song%20%28Vol.%20I%2C%20p.%20389%29%2C%20What%20ship%20would%20bear%20me%20ever%20back%20across%20so%0Awide%20a%20Sea%3F%2C%20refer%20to%20the%20special%20position%20of%20Galadriel.%20She%20was%20the%20last%0Asurvivor%20of%20the%20princes%20and%20queens%20who%20had%20led%20the%20revolting%20Noldor%20to%0Aexile%20in%20Middle-earth.%20After%20the%20overthrow%20of%20Morgoth%20at%20the%20end%20of%20the%0AFirst%20Age%20a%20ban%20was%20set%20upon%20her%20return%2C%20and%20she%20had%20replied%20proudly%20that%0Ashe%20had%20no%20wish%20to%20do%20so.%20She%20passed%20over%20the%20Mountains%20of%20Eredluin%20with%0Aher%20husband%20Celeborn%20%28one%20of%20the%20Sindar%29%20and%20went%20to%20Eregion.%20But%20it%20was%0Aimpossible%20for%20one%20of%20the%20High-Elves%20to%20overcome%20the%20yearning%20for%20the%0ASea%2C%20and%20the%20longing%20to%20pass%20over%20it%20again%20to%20the%20land%20of%20their%20former%0Abliss.%20She%20was%20now%20burdened%20with%20this%20desire.%20In%20the%20event%2C%20after%20the%0Afall%20of%20Sauron%2C%20in%20reward%20for%20all%20that%20she%20had%20done%20to%20oppose%20him%2C%20but%0Aabove%20all%20for%20her%20rejection%20of%20the%20Ring%20when%20it%20came%20within%20her%20power%2C%0Athe%20ban%20was%20lifted%2C%20and%20she%20returned%20over%20the%20Sea%2C%20as%20is%20told%20at%20the%20end%0Aof%20The%20Lord%20of%20the%20Rings.%22%0A%0A--%0ATar-Elenion%0A%0AExtremism%20in%20defense%20of%20liberty%20is%20no%20vice.%0AModeration%20in%20pursuit%20of%20justice%20is%20no%20virtue.%0A%0A%0A
In%20article%20%3Chl%25Pa.46997$H17.14290@sccrnsc02%3E%20in%0Arec.arts.books.tolkien%2C%20Matt%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0A%0AHoME%20is%20a%20good%20_dozen_%20books%2C%20not%20a%20book.%20Read%20Unfinished%20Tales%2F%0Afirst.%20See%20how%20well%20you%20can%20tolerate%20the%20mix%20of%20%22tale%22%2C%20commentary%2C%0Aand%20notes.%20If%20UT%20leaves%20you%20wanting%20more%2C%20then%20try%20HoME.%0A%0ASteuard%20Jensen%20has%20reading%20suggestions%20in%20the%20FAQ%3B%20see%20URL%20below.%0A%0A--%0AStan%20Brown%2C%20Oak%20Road%20Systems%2C%20Cortland%20County%2C%20New%20York%2C%20USA%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20http:%2F%2FOakRoadSystems.com%0ATolkien%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2FTolkien.slimy.com%20%28Steuard%20Jensen%27s%20site%29%0ATolkien%20letters%20FAQ:%0A%20%20%20http:%2F%2Fusers.telerama.com%2F~taliesen%2Ftolkien%2Flettersfaq.html%0AFAQ%20of%20the%20Rings:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Fgenl%2Fringfaq.htm%0AEncyclopedia%20of%20Arda:%20http:%2F%2Fwww.glyphweb.com%2Farda%2Fdefault.htm%0Amore%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Ftech%2Ffaqget.htm%0A%0A%0A
In%20article%20%3CiJvNa.2913$41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20in=20%0Arec.arts.books.tolkien%2C%20A%20Tsar%20Is%20Born=20%0A%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0All%0Ao%0A%0AFirst%2C%20sentimental%20reasons:%20Elwing%27s%20grandfather%20and%20grandmother%20had=20%0Awon%20it%20from%20Morgoth%20after%20terrible%20privations.%20Had%20it%20been%20a%20mere%20=20%0Apiece%20of%20gravel%20I%20think%20it%20would%20have%20been%20precious%20to%20them%20for%20that=20%0Areason.%0A%0ASecond%2C%20the%20Silmaril%20had%20some%20sort%20of%20power%20to%20heal%20the%20hurts%20of=20%0AMiddle-earth.%20When%20L=FAthien%20wore%20it%2C%20%22for%20a%20little%20while%20the%20Land%20of=20%0Athe%20Dead%20that%20Live%20became%20like%20a%20vision%20of%20the%20land%20of%20the%20Valar%2C=20%0Aand%20no%20place%20has%20been%20since%20so%20fair%2C%20so%20fruitful%2C%20or%20so%20filled%20with=20%0Alight.%22%0A%0AThird%2C%20the%20thing%20was%20pretty%20in%20itself%2C%20and%20it%20beautified%20its%20wearer:=20%0A%22Then%20Dior%20arose%2C%20and%20about%20his%20neck%20he%20clasped%20the%20Nauglam=EDr%3B%20and=20%0Anow%20he%20appeared%20as%20the%20fairest%20of%20all%20the%20children%20of%20the%20world%2C%20of=20%0Athreefold%20race:%20of%20the%20Edain%2C%20and%20of%20the%20Eldar%2C%20and%20of%20the%20Maiar%20of=20%0Athe%20Blessed%20Realm.%22%0A%0AFourth%2C%20Dior%20would%20not%20have%20turned%20it%20over%20because%20the%20demand%20came=20%0Afrom%20Celegorm%20and%20Curufin%2C%20who%20had%20essentially%20tried%20to%20rape%20his=20%0Amother.%20And%20Elwing%20would%20not%20turn%20it%20over%20to%20the%20remaining%20brothers%2C=20%0Awho%20had%20murdered%20her%20father.%0A%0ATolkien%20sums%20it%20all%20up%20in%20the%20%22War%20of%20Wrath%22%20chapter:%20%22Then%20Elwing=20%0Aand%20the%20people%20of%20Sirion%20would%20not%20yield%20the%20jewel%20which%20Beren%20had=20%0Awon%20and%20L=FAthien%20had%20worn%2C%20and%20for%20which%20Dior%20the%20fair%20was%20slain%3B%20and=20%0Aleast%20of%20all%20while%20E=E4rendil%20their%20lord%20was%20on%20the%20sea%2C%20for%20it%20seemed=20%0Ato%20them%20that%20in%20the%20Silmaril%20lay%20the%20healing%20and%20the%20blessing%20that=20%0Ahad%20come%20upon%20their%20houses%20and%20their%20ships.%22%0A%0A%0AI%20don%27t%20think%20anyone%20knew%20that%20then.%20Maedhros%20and%20Maglor%20were=20%0Asurprised%20to%20discover%20it%20later.%0A%0A--=20%0AStan%20Brown%2C%20Oak%20Road%20Systems%2C%20Cortland%20County%2C%20New%20York%2C%20USA%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20http:%2F%2FOakRoadSystems.com%0ATolkien%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2FTolkien.slimy.com%20%28Steuard%20Jensen%27s%20site%29%0ATolkien%20letters%20FAQ:%0A%20%20%20http:%2F%2Fusers.telerama.com%2F~taliesen%2Ftolkien%2Flettersfaq.html%0AFAQ%20of%20the%20Rings:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Fgenl%2Fringfaq.htm%0AEncyclopedia%20of%20Arda:%20http:%2F%2Fwww.glyphweb.com%2Farda%2Fdefault.htm%0Amore%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Ftech%2Ffaqget.htm%0A%0A%0A
