In%20article%20%3ClLxRa.81425$N7.10994@sccrnsc03%3E%20in%0Arec.arts.books.tolkien%2C%20Joe%20Seamour%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0AI%20don%27t%20quite%20understand%20your%20sentence%20structure%2C%20but%20the%20rule%20of%0Athumb%20is%20that%20something%20is%20wrong%20if%20quoted%20material%20is%20longer%20than%0Anew%20material.%20Ideally%20the%20proportion%20of%20quoted%20material%20would%20be%0Awell%20under%2050%25.%0A%0ACertainly%20one%20would%20never%20quote%20a%20signature%2C%20unless%20commenting%20on%0Athe%20signature.%0A%0AYou%20might%20find%20this%20page%20helpful:%0A%09http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Fgenl%2Funice.htm%0A%0A--%0AStan%20Brown%2C%20Oak%20Road%20Systems%2C%20Cortland%20County%2C%20New%20York%2C%20USA%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20http:%2F%2FOakRoadSystems.com%0ATolkien%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2FTolkien.slimy.com%20%28Steuard%20Jensen%27s%20site%29%0ATolkien%20letters%20FAQ:%0A%20%20%20http:%2F%2Fusers.telerama.com%2F~taliesen%2Ftolkien%2Flettersfaq.html%0AFAQ%20of%20the%20Rings:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Fgenl%2Fringfaq.htm%0AEncyclopedia%20of%20Arda:%20http:%2F%2Fwww.glyphweb.com%2Farda%2Fdefault.htm%0Amore%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Ftech%2Ffaqget.htm%0A%0A%0A
In%20article%20%3Cmair_fheal-3007031913440001@198.144.214.86%3E%2C%0Acoyotes%20rand%20mair%20fheal%20greykitten%20tomys%20des%20anges%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0AWell%2C%20my%20english%20translation%20%28supposedly%20directly%20from%20the%20oldest%20available%0AHebrew%20texts%20to%20contemporary%20American%20english%29%20of%20Genesis%20chapter%206%20begins:%0A%0AWhen%20men%20began%20to%20multiply%20on%20earth%20and%20daughters%20were%20born%20to%20them%2C%0Athe%20sons%20of%20heaven%20saw%20how%20beautiful%20the%20daughters%20of%20man%20were%2C%20and%20so%0Athey%20took%20for%20their%20wives%20as%20many%20of%20them%20as%20they%20chose.%0AThen%20the%20LORD%20said:%20%22My%20spirit%20shall%20not%20remain%20in%20man%20forever%2C%20since%20he%0Ais%20but%20flesh.%20His%20days%20shall%20comprise%20one%20hundred%20and%20twenty%20years.%22%0AAt%20that%20time%20the%20Nephilim%20appeared%20on%20earth%20%28as%20well%20as%20later%29%2C%20after%0Athe%20sons%20of%20heaven%20had%20intercourse%20with%20the%20daughters%20of%20man%2C%20who%20bore%0Athem%20sons.%20They%20were%20the%20heroes%20of%20old%2C%20the%20men%20of%20renown.%0A%0AThis%20is%20usually%20interpreted%20as%20Angels%20f%2Acking%20human%20women%2C%20as%20an%20elective%2C%0Aextra-curricular%20activity%20and%20not%20under%20orders%20from%20God.%20%20What%20is%20your%0Atake%20on%20it%3F%0A%0A--%0Apciszek%20at%20TheWorld%20dot%20com%20%20%20%20%20%7C%20%20%22Mundus%20Vult%20Decipi%22%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%20%20%28%22The%20world%20wants%20to%20be%20deceived%22%29%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20--James%20Branch%20Cabell%0A%0A%0A
In%20article%20%3Cslrnbgdqud.17s.maureen-taocow-ng1@whop-paC-%0A006c.alberni.net%3E%20in%20rec.arts.books.tolkien%2C%20AC%20%3Cmaureen-taocow-%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0AI%20don%27t%20buy%20that%2C%20and%20I%20bet%20Tolkien%20wouldn%27t%20either.%20Sure%2C%20it%20wasn%27t%0ATurin%27s%20fault%20that%20his%20mother%20was%20lost%20on%20the%20road%20or%20that%20his%0Asister%20was%20ensorcelled%20by%20Glaurung.%20But%20he%20made%20plenty%20of%20trouble%0Afor%20himself%2C%20again%20and%20again.%0A%0AMorgoth%20didn%27t%20make%20Turin%20insist%20on%20building%20a%20bridge%20over%20the%20River%0ANarog.%20Morgoth%20didn%27t%20make%20Turin%20kill%20a%20noble%20in%20Thingol%27s%20court.%0ATurin%20was%20both%20self-willed%20and%20hasty%2C%20a%20dangerous%20combination.%0A%0AWould%20I%20have%20done%20any%20better%20in%20his%20place%3F%20Probably%20not%20--%20I%20am%0Aself-willed%20and%20hasty%20too.%20But%20that%27s%20my%20point.%0A%0ARemember%20Gandalf%27s%20speech%20about%20tilling%20the%20soil%20we%20have%2C%20but%20not%0Abeing%20able%20to%20control%20the%20weather%3F%20Turin%20didn%27t%20do%20a%20very%20good%20job%0Aof%20tilling%20his%20own%20soil.%0A%0A--%0AStan%20Brown%2C%20Oak%20Road%20Systems%2C%20Cortland%20County%2C%20New%20York%2C%20USA%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20http:%2F%2FOakRoadSystems.com%0ATolkien%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2FTolkien.slimy.com%20%28Steuard%20Jensen%27s%20site%29%0ATolkien%20letters%20FAQ:%0A%20%20%20http:%2F%2Fusers.telerama.com%2F~taliesen%2Ftolkien%2Flettersfaq.html%0AFAQ%20of%20the%20Rings:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Fgenl%2Fringfaq.htm%0AEncyclopedia%20of%20Arda:%20http:%2F%2Fwww.glyphweb.com%2Farda%2Fdefault.htm%0Amore%20FAQs:%20http:%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Ftech%2Ffaqget.htm%0A%0A%0A
