On%20Sat%2C%2012%20Jul%202003%2009:58:15%20-0700%2C%0Acoyotes%20morgan%20mair%20fheal%20greykitten%20tomys%20des%20anges%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0AI%20had%20always%20assumed%20that%20it%20was%20more%20of%20a%20show%20of%20power.%20%20Galadriel%2C%0ASaruman%2C%20Gandalf%20and%20Elrond%20%28and%20whoever%20else%20was%20on%20the%20council%2C%20likely%0Asome%20Noldor%20likely%20Glorifindel%29%20were%20pretty%20powerful%20beings.%20%20However%2C%0ASauron%27s%20retreat%20was%20preplanned%20and%20feigned%2C%20so%20whatever%20means%20were%20used%20to%0Aevict%20him%2C%20it%20was%20too%20late%20for%20any%20meaningful%20injury%20to%20Sauron%20or%20his%20plans.%0A%0A--%0AAaron%20Clausen%0A%41nospam@nospam.net%0A%0A%0A
