On%20Sat%2C%2026%20Jul%202003%2012:33:26%20+0200%2C%20%22%D6jevind%20L%E5ng%22%0A%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0ANow%2C%20dear%20reader%2C%20you%20must%20remember%20that%20Two%20Gun%20had%20been%20a%20very%0Anaughty%20boy%2C%20who%20had%20been%20perfectly%20%2A%2Ahorrid%2A%2A%20to%20all%20the%20little%0Acowgirls%20and%20that%20was%20why%20he%20was%20mewling.%20%20Now%20I%20am%20sure%20that%20all%20of%0Ayou%20are%20well%20mannered%20little%20boys%20and%20girls%20and%20would%20NEVER%20do%0Aanything%20like%20that.%20%20Well%2C%20Two%20Gun%20looked%20at%20Ojevind%20and%20said%20%22I%20am%0Areally%20quite%20sorry%20Pater%2C%20and%20I%20promise%20I%20will%20not%20be%20so%20naughty%20a%20boy%0Aagain%20if%20only%20you%20will%20forgive%20me%20and%20I%20will%20promise%20to%20be%20the%20very%0Abest%20little%20boy%20ever.%22%20%20And%20the%20good%20fairy%2C%20Quentin%20Crisp%2C%20appeared%0Aand%20turned%20Two%20Gun%20back%20as%20he%20was%2C%20without%20even%20a%20spot%20on%20his%20velvet%0Abuckaroo%20outfit%21%0A%0AAnd%20Ojevind%20wrinkled%20up%20his%20perfectly%20nice%20and%20spottidy%20pottidy%20tie%0Aand%20said%20%22Oh%20dear%2C%20oh%20my%20goodness%21%20%20I%20seem%20to%20have%20have%20fallen%20into%20a%0Amoralistic%20English%20Victorian%20Fairy%20Story%2C%20and%20not%20even%20a%20slightly%20rude%0Astory%20like%20one%20by%20that%20Saki%20fellow.%20%20Whatever%20shall%20I%20do%3F%22%0A%0ANow%2C%20boys%20and%20girls%20can%20you%20put%20on%20your%20thinking%20caps%20and%20think%20of%0Awhat%20kindly%20Onkle%20Oje%20did%3F%0A%0AWell%2C%20what%20he%20did%20was...%0A%0A%0A%0A%20--%0ASindamor%20Pandaturion%0A%5Bremove%20-remove-%20to%20reply%5D%0A%0A%0A
On%20Sun%2C%2003%20Aug%202003%2009:09:29%20-0700%2C%20Paul%20S.%20Person%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%0Awrote:%0A%0A%0AGoing%20back%20to%20the%20beginning%20of%20the%20thread%2C%20it%20seems%20that%20confusion%20entered%0Awhen%20someone%20used%20the%20term%20%22Judaeo-Christian%22.%20The%20confusion%20arises%20from%0Adiffering%20conceptions%20of%20angels%20in%20Judaism%20and%20Christianity.%20I%20believe%20the%0Aterm%20Judaeo-Christian%20was%20coined%20by%20American%20sociologists%20%28I%20could%20be%20wrong%0Aabout%20that%29%2C%20and%20it%20can%20be%20misleading%20when%20applied%20to%20theology.%0A%0ATolkien%20%28and%20C.S.%20Lewis%2C%20with%20his%20%22eldila%22%29%20both%20developed%20imaginary%20creatures%0Ain%20their%20fiction%20that%20were%20based%20on%20the%20Christian%2C%20rather%20than%20the%20Jewish%0Aconception%20of%20angels%2C%20though%20they%20did%20not%20use%20the%20word%20%22angel%22%20to%20describe%0Athem.%20Their%20fellow%20Inkling%2C%20Charles%20Williams%2C%20was%20more%20explicit%20in%20mentioning%0Athe%20%22Dionysian%20Nine%22.%0A%0AIn%20Christian%20theology%20%22angel%22%20is%20used%20in%20two%20senses%20-%20to%20refer%20to%20the%20lowest%0Aorder%20of%20the%20nine%2C%20and%20also%2C%20more%20loosely%2C%20to%20refer%20to%20all%20nine%20orders.%0A%0AThe%20thrones%2C%20dominions%20rulers%20and%20authorities%20surely%20refer%20to%20%2Aboth%2A%20human%0Apower%20structures%20and%20their%20angelic%20counterparts%2C%20which%20are%20closely%20linked%20%28see%0AG.B.%20Caird%2C%20%22Principalities%20and%20powers%22%2C%20and%20the%20works%20of%20people%20like%20Walter%0Awink%29.%20This%20lay%20behind%20the%20Roman%20civil%20religion%20of%20emperor%20worship%20and%20the%0Ainstitution%20of%20divine%20kingship%2C%20and%20is%20reflected%20in%20Old%20Testament%20passages%0Alike%20Psalm%2081%2F82%2C%20and%20Deuteronomy%2032:8-9.%0A%0AI%20don%27t%20know%20whether%20one%20could%20find%20exact%20weuivalents%20between%20the%20Valar%2C%0AMaiar%2C%20Istari%20etc%20and%20the%20Dionysian%20Nine%20%28even%20Williams%20shuffled%20them%20around%29%2C%0Abut%20for%20Tolkien%20they%20are%20clearly%20divided%20into%20different%20orders.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A--%0ASteve%20Hayes%0AE-mail:%41nospam@nospam.net%0AWeb:%20http:%2F%2Fwww.geocities.com%2Fhayesstw%2Fstevesig.htm%0A%0A%0A
