ed%22%20%20%22It%20was%20right%20%20after%20he%20took%20a%20course%20in%20Zen%20at%0ABear%20Creek%20Extension%20school%2C%20taught%20by%20old%20Squint%20Eyed%20Ikkyu.%20%20Fust%20he%0Ahad%20to%20deliver%20a%20still%20born%20child%20in%20a%20putrified%20forest%2C%20then%20drink%0Aall%20the%20waters%20up%20of%20the%20Pecos%20River.%20%20I%20reckon%20he%20was%20a%20mite%0Aenthusiastic%20though%2C%20his%20Sensei%20hombre%20just%20asked%20him%20what%20was%20the%0Asound%20of%20one%20balrog%20wing%20flapping%20and%20he%20went%20and%20yanked%20both%20off.%0AThe%20pernt%20is%20we%20have%20a%20situation%20back%20in%20Bear%20Creek%20we%20need%20his%20hep%0Afor%2C%20some%20low%20down-gut-shooting-cattle-rustling%20varmints%20from%20the%0AValley%20of%20Fear...%22%0A%0AAs%20soon%20as%20she%20said%20the%20words%20%22Valley%20of%20Fear%22%20%20a%20gaunt%20man%20wearing%20a%0Adearstalker%20cap%20and%20a%20beard%20stood%20up%20and%20removed%20both.%20%20Placing%20a%20worn%0Ameerschaum%20pipe%20with%20a%20vaguely%20oriental%20aroma%20about%20it%20in%20his%20pocket%2C%0Ahe%20declared...%0A%0A%20--%0ASindamor%20Pandaturion%0A%5Bremove%20-remove-%20to%20reply%5D%0A%0A%0A
