On%20Wed%2C%2023%20Jul%202003%2020:09:24%20GMT%2C%0ASLJ%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A%0AThat%2C%20apparently%2C%20is%20not%20what%20happened%20to%20Sauron.%20%20Even%20Saruman%27s%20body%2C%0Athough%20it%20obviously%20changed%20after%20his%20death%2C%20was%20still%20there.%20%20Gandalf%27s%0Abody%2C%20as%20well%2C%20lay%20at%20the%20pinnacle%20of%20Zirak-zagil%20%28sp%3F%29%20until%20his%20spirit%0Areturned.%0A%0A%0AI%20know%20of%20three%20cases%20where%20Ainur%20were%20killed%20%28or%20disincarnated%20if%20you%0Alike%29%3B%20Sauron%2C%20Saruman%20and%20Gandalf.%20%20In%20all%20three%20cases%2C%20there%20were%20bodies%0Aleft%20behind.%20%20This%20is%20because%20%28in%20my%20opinion%2C%20at%20least%29%20their%20bodies%20are%20not%0Amade%20out%20of%20magic%2Fmana%2Fspiritual%20stuff%2C%20but%20are%20actually%20physical.%20%20The%0AIstari%2C%20for%20instance%2C%20were%20said%20to%20have%20taken%20on%20the%20bodies%20of%20men%2C%20real%20and%0Anot%20feigned.%20%20While%20this%20struck%20a%20debate%20a%20month%20or%20two%20ago%20about%20what%20that%0Aexactly%20meant%20as%20far%20as%20the%20fate%20of%20the%20Istari%2C%20it%20does%20indicate%2C%20if%20nothing%0Aelse%2C%20that%20their%20bodies%20were%20made%20of%20the%20same%20stuff%20as%20Elves%2C%20Men%20and%0ADwarves%3B%20that%20is%20flesh%20and%20bone.%0A%0A%0AIn%20the%20end%20Morgoth%20was%20stuck%20in%20a%20single%20body.%20%20He%20had%20put%20forth%20so%20much%20of%0Ahis%20power%20that%20he%20no%20longer%20retained%20this%20capacity%20that%20the%20rest%20of%20the%0AValar%20still%20had.%0A%0ASo%20my%20feeling%2C%20at%20the%20end%20of%20the%20day%2C%20is%20that%2C%20in%20fact%2C%20when%20an%20Ainu%20is%0Akilled%2C%20there%20is%20a%20physical%20body%20left.%20%20Perhaps%20if%20they%20willfully%0Adisincarnate%20themselves%2C%20the%20body%20simply%20disappears%2C%20or%20perhaps%20they%20get%20rid%0Aof%20it%20%28so%20to%20speak%29%20so%20as%20to%20not%20leave%20a%20carcass%20rotting.%20%20After%20all%2C%20in%20the%0Abeginning%2C%20the%20Ainur%20did%20manipulate%20the%20stuff%20of%20Arda%20to%20bring%20it%20into%20a%0Aform%20that%20could%20sustain%20the%20Children%20of%20Illuvatar.%20%20Creating%20a%20new%20form%2C%0Aeven%20one%20that%20aged%20and%20required%20rest%20and%20sustenance%20could%20not%20have%20been%20that%0Adifficult%20for%20them.%0A%0A--%0AAaron%20Clausen%0A%41nospam@nospam.net%0A%0A%0A
