Paul%20Ciszek%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A:%20In%20article%20%3C9oyVa.58321$41nospam@nospam.net%3E%2C%0A:%20Bill%20O%27Meally%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A:%3E%0A:%3EAngelic%20nature%20%28ie.%2C%20of%20the%20race%20of%20the%20Ainur%2C%20%2Anot%2A%20Elves%20or%0A:%3EHalf-elven%29%20has%20nothing%20to%20do%20with%20hair%20color.%20Galadriel%20was%20of%20the%20line%0A:%3Eof%20Finarfin%2C%20who%20have%20golden%20hair%20as%20a%20family%20trait.%0A%0A:%20And%20her%20husband%27s%20hair%20was%20silver.%20%20Legolas%2C%20in%20the%20movie%2C%20has%20%22peroxide%0A:%20blonde%22%20hair%2C%20not%20quite%20colorless%3B%20what%20was%20his%20hair%20color%20in%20the%20book%3F%0A:%20The%20movie%20also%20had%20a%20red-haired%20elf%20in%20the%20leave-taking%20scene%20at%20Rivendell%0A:%20%28extended%20edition%20only%2C%20I%20think%29%3B%20is%20there%20any%20basis%20in%20Tolkien%20for%0A:%20Elvish%20redheads%3F%0A%0A%0AYes.%20%20Feanor%27s%20wife%2C%20his%20wife%27s%20husband%2C%20and%20two%20of%20his%20children%0Awere%20redheads.%0A%0AStephen%0A%0A%0A
Paul%20Ciszek%20said:%0A%7Bsnip%7D%0A%0AYes%2C%20but%20he%20said%20that%20they%20only%20succeeded%20in%20preserving%20the%20dead%20flesh.%20I%27ve%0Aalways%20taken%20that%20to%20mean%20that%20they%20had%20mastered%20the%20art%20of%20mummification%0Aand%2For%20embalming.%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%22The%20narrative%20ends%20here.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20There%20is%20no%20reason%20to%20think%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%2F%2F%0A%28%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20that%20any%20more%20was%20ever%20written.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%2F%2F%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20The%20manuscript%2C%20which%20becomes%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20increasingly%20rapid%20towards%20the%20end%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%0A%28%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20peters%20out%20in%20a%20scrawl.%22%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%7C%0A%7C%7C%20%20%20%20%20-Christopher%20Tolkien%2C%20_The%20Lost%20Road_%20%20%2F%2F%20%7C%7C%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
Paul%20Ciszek%20said:%0A%7Bsnip%7D%0A%7Bsnip%7D%0A%0AThe%20Sons%20of%20Feanor%20looted%20Menegroth%20and%20later%20looted%20the%20refugees%20at%20the%0AMouth%20of%20Sirion.%0A%0A%0A%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%22The%20narrative%20ends%20here.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20There%20is%20no%20reason%20to%20think%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%7C%2F%2F%0A%28%2F%20%2F%2F%20%20%20%20that%20any%20more%20was%20ever%20written.%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%2F%2F%0A%7C%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20The%20manuscript%2C%20which%20becomes%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%0A%7C%2F%2F%20%20%20%20increasingly%20rapid%20towards%20the%20end%2C%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%0A%28%2F%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20peters%20out%20in%20a%20scrawl.%22%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%7C%7C%0A%7C%7C%20%20%20%20%20-Christopher%20Tolkien%2C%20_The%20Lost%20Road_%20%20%2F%2F%20%7C%7C%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
Paul%20Ciszek%20wrote:%0A%0Ahttp:%2F%2Ffan.theonering.net%2Fmiddleearthtours%2Fmovies3a.html%20on%20Pippin%27s%20jerkin%0A%0Ahttp:%2F%2Fwww.warofthering.net%2Fmovies%2Fphotos%2Fcalendarfull%2F%20on%20Aragorn%27s%0Abreastplate%20%28partially%20obscured%29%0A%0A--%0ASpeaking%20Clock%0A%0A%22Inevitably%20the%20myths%20woven%20by%20us%2C%20though%20they%20contain%20error%2C%20will%20also%0Areflect%20a%20splintered%20fragment%20of%20the%20true%20light.%22%0A%0A%0A%0A
Paul%20S.%20Person%20%20in%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%0Ascripsit:%0A%0AFrodo%20is%2C%20from%20the%20beginning%2C%20closely%20connected%20with%20the%20Elves.%20He%20can%0Aspeak%20Sindarin%20and%20a%20little%20Quenya.%20Gildor%20names%20him%20Elf-friend%2C%20and%0Aso%20does%20Goldberry%20%28%22I%20see%20you%20are%20an%20elf-friend%3B%20the%20light%20in%20your%0Aeyes%20and%20the%20ring%20in%20your%20voice%20tells%20it%22%29.%20After%20Weathertop%2C%20he%20can%0Apartly%20see%20the%20wraith-world%2C%20like%20the%20Eldar.%20When%20he%20meets%20Saruman%20in%0A%22The%20Scouring%20of%20the%20Shire%22%2C%20he%20pities%20him%20%28just%20like%20he%20has%20pitied%0AGollum%29%20and%20Saruman%20says%20%22You%20have%20grown%2C%20Halfling.%20Yes%2C%20you%20have%0Agrown%20very%20much.%20You%20are%20wise%2C%20and%20cruel%22:%20Frodo%20is%20now%20more%20an%20Elf%0Athan%20a%20Hobbit.%0A%0AFor%20Merry%20and%20Pippin%2C%20Tooks%20and%20Brandybucks%20are%20noted%20as%20being%20apart%0Afrom%20the%20other%20Hobbits.%20Tooks%20%22produce%20in%20every%20generation%20strong%0Acharacters%20of%20peculiar%20habits%20and%20even%20adventurous%20temperament%22%2C%20and%0Afor%20Brandybucks%2C%20%22no%20wonder%20they%27re%20queer%2C%20if%20they%20live%20on%20the%20wrong%0Aside%20of%20the%20Brandywine%20River%2C%20and%20right%20agin%20the%20Old%20Forest%22%2C%20says%0ADaddy%20Twofoot.%20Merry%20later%20tooks%20service%20with%20Th%E9oden%20and%20becomes%20a%0Akinght%20of%20Rohan.%20Pippin%20enters%20into%20the%20service%20of%20Denethor%2C%20and%20is%0Amade%20a%20guard%20of%20the%20Citadel.%20Because%20they%20drank%20the%20Ent-draughts%2C%20they%0Aboth%20are%20the%20tallest%20Hobbits%20in%20history.%20At%20the%20end%2C%20they%20ride%20to%0AGondor%20and%20they%20are%20buried%20in%20the%20Rath%20D%EDnen%2C%20among%20the%20King%20of%0AGondor.%20So%20they%20became%20both%20more%20Men%20than%20Hobbits.%0A%0AThat%20leaves%20Sam.%20IMHO%2C%20he%27s%20the%20only%20%22true%22%20Hobbit%20of%20the%0AFellowship.%20He%27s%20the%20gardener%2C%20the%20%22lover%20of%20trees%22.%20Galadriel%20gives%0Ahim%20a%20true%20Hobbit%20present%2C%20earth%20from%20her%20orchard%2C%20for%20things%20to%20grow%0Aand%20bloom.%20He%20cares%20about%20cooking%20and%20eating%20when%20he%20travels%20with%0AFrodo.%20He%20can%20easily%20reject%20the%20lure%20of%20the%20Ring.%20And%20when%20the%20Ring%0Atries%20to%20tempt%20him%20at%20the%20tower%20of%20Cirith%20Ungol%2C%20it%27s%20with%20the%20vision%0Aof%20a%20garden:%20%22And%20then%20all%20the%20clouds%20rolled%20away%2C%20and%20the%20white%20sun%0Ashone%2C%20and%20at%20his%20command%20the%20vale%20of%20Gorgoroth%20became%20a%20garden%20of%0Aflowers%20and%20trees%20and%20brought%20forth%20fruit.%22%20He%20rejects%20the%20vision:%0A%22The%20one%20small%20garden%20of%20a%20free%20gardener%20was%20all%20his%20need%20and%20due%2C%20not%0Aa%20garden%20swollen%20to%20a%20realm%3B%20his%20own%20hands%20to%20use%2C%20not%20the%20hands%20of%0Aothers%20to%20command.%22%0A%0AThat%27s%20my%20point%20--well%2C%20not%20exactly%20mine%2C%20a%20friend%20states%20this%20theory%0Ain%20his%20homepage:%0A%3Chttp:%2F%2Fwww.eleves.ens.fr%2Fhome%2Fperona%2FTolkien%2FSam.html%3E%20%28in%20French%29%0AI%20found%20it%20very%20insightful.%0A%0A--%0AMarie-Lan%20Nguyen%0A%AB%A0Et%20ideo%20ego%20adulescentulos%20existimo%20in%20scholis%20stultissimos%20fieri%2C%0Aquia%20nihil%20ex%20his%2C%20quae%20in%20usu%20habemus%2C%20aut%20audiunt%20aut%20vident.%A0%BB%0AC.%20Petronius%20Arbiter%2C%20_Satyricon_%0A%0A%0A
Paul%20S.%20Person%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20writes:%0A%0A%0AI%20don%27t%20think%20you%20recall%20correctly.%20%20From%20the%20prologue:%20%22But%20in%20that%0Awar%20the%20North%20Kingdom%20ended%3B%20and%20then%20the%20Hobbits%20took%20the%20land%20for%0Atheir%20own%2C%20and%20they%20chose%20from%20their%20own%20chiefs%20a%20Thain%20to%20hold%20the%0Aauthority%20of%20the%20king%20that%20was%20gone.%22%0A%0A--%0ADean%20Tiegs%2C%20NE%C2%BC-20-52-25-W4%0A%E2%80%9CConfortare%20et%20esto%20robustus%E2%80%9D%0Ahttp:%2F%2Ftelusplanet.net%2Fpublic%2Fdctiegs%2F%0A%0A%0A
Paul%20S.%20Person%20wrote:%0A%0A%5BSNIP%5D%0A%0A%0AActually%2C%20SLEWOSMP%20is%20not%20a%20bad%20acronym%20for%20it.%0A%0ASLEWOSMP%20%20n.%20%20sloo%20-%20er%20-%20sump%0AA%20pit%20that%20can%20appear%20to%20be%20bottomless%2C%20used%20for%20draining%20money%20from%20those%0Athat%20have%20far%20to%20much%20of%20it%2C%20by%20providing%20in%20return%2C%20useless%2C%20cheaply%0Aproduced%20crap%20with%20the%20expectation%20that%20there%20will%20be%20only%20a%20limited%20amount%0Aof%20this%20crap%20available%20as%20an%20incentive%20to%20purchase.%0A%0ASee%20also:%20-%20Sewer%20Sump.%0A%0A%0A--%0ARegards%2C%0A%0AMichael%20Cole%0A%0A%0A%0A%0A
