_Dune_%20by%20Frank%20Herbert.%20%20This%20one%27s%20a%20no%20brainer%2C%20only%20we%20have%20to%20talk%20about%0Ahow%20it%20is%20linked%20to%20The%20Lord%20of%20the%20Rings.%20%20The%20scale%20is%20galactic%20empire%2C%20the%0Astage%20is%20a%20planet%20named%20Arrakis.%20%20There%27s%20no%20water%2C%20really%2C%20on%20Dune%2C%20but%20the%0Ainhabitants%20have%20grown%20tough%20conserving%20what%20water%20there%20is.%20%20That%20means%0Adrinking%20their%20peepee%20and%20eating%20the%20drug%20melange%2C%20which%20in%20French%20means%20what%0A%27halo-halo%27%20means%20in%20tagalog%2C%20which%20is%20really%20kind%20of%20like%20%27mixed%27%20or%0A%27splotched%27%20in%20English.%20%20Ja%21%20%20Ve%20haffen%20ze%20Germanz%20in%20Dune%20as%20well%2C%20with%20Baron%0AHarkonnen%20and%20Feyd%20Rautha%2C%20while%20Ruatha%20Hold%20is%20Jaxom%27s%20Lordship%20in%20_The%20White%0ADragon_%2C%20by%20Anne%20McCaffrey.%20%20Jaxom%20rides%20this%20puny%20version%20of%20regular%20dragons%2C%0Abut%20it%20is%20still%20big%20enough%20to%20carry%20his%20weight%20easily%2C%20and%20the%20color%20of%20the%0Abeast%20is%20whitish%20like%20the%20coat%20of%20Saruman.%20%20Ha%21%20%20A%20link%20with%20Tolkien%2C%20cool%21%0A%0A_Dao%20De%20Jing_%20by%20Lao%20Tzu.%20%20Orcs%20are%20a%20bit%20like%20Chinese%2C%20so%20read%20the%20most%20famous%0AChinese%20work%20around.%0A%0A_I%20Am%20Powerful_%20by%20Yukio%20Mishima.%20%20Mishima%20was%20a%20swordsman%20and%20a%20poet%2C%20a%0Arenaissance%20man%20who%20the%20Japs%20revere.%20%20Japs%20are%20little%20like%20Orcs%2C%20so%20read%20the%0Amost%20famous%20Japanese%20gay%20writer%20around.%0A%0A_White%20Fang_%20by%20Jack%20London.%20%20The%20tale%20of%20a%20wolf%20pup%20growing%20up%20in%20the%20Yukon%2C%0Aonly%2C%20he%27s%20raised%20by%20wolves%21%20%20He%20ends%20up%20in%20a%20dog%20house%20of%20a%20wealthy%20white%0Aowner%20after%20bad%20experiences%20with%20the%20low%20life%20Indian%20underclass%20filth%2C%0Athoroughly%20happy%20to%20play%20with%20his%20master%27s%20bunny%20daughters.%20%20Amerindians%20are%20a%0Alittle%20like%20Orcs.%0A%0A%0A
a%20tsar%20is%20born%20wrote%3A%0Awhy%3F%20i%20know%20he%20makes%20a%20lot%20of%20mistakes%20and%20is%20a%20tad%20arrogant%2C%20but%20he%0A%2Ais%2A%20a%20tragic%20hero%3A%20he%20can%27t%20help%20it%21%20it%27s%20always%20fate%20seeming%20to%20work%0Aagainst%20him.%20i%20find%20him%20a%20rather%20sympathetic%20character%20he%20always%0A%2Atries%2A%20to%20make%20the%20right%20choice%2C%20but%20because%20of%20something%20he%20can%27t%0Apossibly%20know%20about%20it%20ends%20up%20working%20against%20him.%0Ajamie%0A--%0A%22the%20more%20i%20see%20of%20the%20world%2C%20the%20more%20am%20i%20dissatisfied%20with%20it%3B%20and%0Aevery%20day%20confirms%20my%20belief%20of%20the%20inconsistency%20of%20all%20human%0Acharacters%2C%20and%20of%20the%20little%20dependence%20that%20can%20be%20placed%20on%20the%0Aappearance%20of%20either%20merit%20or%20sense.%22%0Ajane%20austen%2C%20pride%20and%20prejudice%0A
ac%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%20news%3A%41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0Ayet%20the%20high%20elves%2C%20those%20who%20had%20lived%20in%20the%20undying%20lands%2C%20had%20a%0Asort%20of%20a%20halo%3A%0A%22the%20hobbits%20sat%20in%20shadow%20by%20the%20wayside.%20before%20long%0Athe%20elves%20came%20down%20the%20lane%20towards%20the%20valley.%20they%20passed%20slowly%2C%0Aand%20the%20hobbits%20could%20see%20the%20starlight%20glimmering%20on%20their%20hair%20and%0Ain%20their%20eyes.%20they%20bore%20no%20lights%2C%20yet%20as%20they%20walked%20a%20shimmer%2C%20like%0Athe%20light%20of%20the%20moon%20above%20the%20rim%20of%20the%20hills%20before%20it%20rises%2C%0Aseemed%20to%20fall%20about%20their%20feet.%20they%20were%20now%20silent%2C%20and%20as%20the%20last%0Aelf%20passed%20he%20turned%20and%20looked%20towards%20the%20hobbits%20and%20laughed.%20%22%0A-%20j.r.r.%20tolkien%2C%20the%20fellowship%20of%20the%20ring%2C%20chapter%20iii%0Awhere%20did%20this%20shimmer%20come%20from%3F%20i%20thought%20it%20was%20an%20effect%20of%0Aliving%20in%20proximity%20of%20the%20two%20trees.%0Awas%20it%20rather%20the%20result%20of%20eye%20makeup%20and%20hair%20products%3F%0A--terry%0A
