conrad%20dunkerson%20wrote%3A%0A%3Csnip%3E%0A%3E%20why%20did%20faramir%20hear%20the%20horn%3F%20was%20it%20just%20a%20%27daydream%27%20or%20his%0A%3E%20imagination%2C%20that%20just%20happened%20to%20coincide%20with%20the%20time%20the%20horn%0A%3E%20was%20being%20blown%3F%20if%20faramir%20actually%20%27heard%27%20that%20horn%20because%0A%3E%20boromir%20was%20blowing%20it%20then%20we%20are%20talking%20magic.%20if%20not%2C%20we%20are%0A%3E%20talking%20amazing%20coincidence...%20which%20in%20middle-earth%20often%20means%0A%3E%20%27divine%20intervention%27.%20%3A%29%0Ai%20certainly%20don%27t%20think%20he%20%2Aactually%2A%20heard%20boromir%27s%20horn%20%28why%20only%0Ahim%2C%20and%20apparently%20no-one%20else%2C%20if%20it%27s%20just%20a%20straightforward%20case%20of%0Ahearing%3F%29.%20and%20in%20a%20previous%20post%20i%20did%20say%20that%20i%20thought%20%22that%20he%20had%0Aa%20presentiment%20of%20doom%20when%20he%20thought%20he%20%27heard%27%22.%20and%20that%27s%20all%20i%0Athink%20there%20is%20to%20it%2C%20in%20which%20case%20that%20fits%20the%20latter%20suggestion%0A%27divine%20intervention%27.%20magic%20just%20doesn%27t%20fit%20the%20evidence%2C%20as%20far%20as%0Ai%27m%20concerned.%0Ajamie%0A--%0A%22the%20more%20i%20see%20of%20the%20world%2C%20the%20more%20am%20i%20dissatisfied%20with%20it%3B%20and%0Aevery%20day%20confirms%20my%20belief%20of%20the%20inconsistency%20of%20all%20human%0Acharacters%2C%20and%20of%20the%20little%20dependence%20that%20can%20be%20placed%20on%20the%0Aappearance%20of%20either%20merit%20or%20sense.%22%0Ajane%20austen%2C%20pride%20and%20prejudice%0A
conrad%20dunkerson%20wrote%3A%0A%3E%20jamie%20armstrong%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%20in%20message%0A%3E%20news%3A%41nospam@nospam.net%3E...%0A%3E%0A%3E%3E%20i%20didn%27t%20say%20it%20did%3A%0A%3E%0A%3E%20ok%2C%20i%20thought%20that%20indirectly%20you%20had...%20tsar%20said%20as%20much%20and%20you%0A%3E%20stated%20you%20agreed%20with%20his%20views.%20presumably%20you%20agree%20with%20the%0A%3E%20interpretation%2C%20but%20not%20that%20it%20is%20incontrovertibly%20established.%0A%3E%0Ayes%3A%20the%20tsar%27s%20sentiments%20have%20my%20full%20support%2C%20but%20not%20the%20way%20he%0Aexpressed%20them%2C%20as%20they%20can%27t%20be%20conclusively%20proved%2C%20imo.%0A%3E%3E%20from%20memory%20i%20really%20can%27t%20see%20that%20there%20can%20be%20any%20issue%20about%0A%3E%3E%20boromir%27s%20horn%20at%20all%3A%20it%27s%20quite%20clear%20to%20me%20from%20what%20faramir%0A%3E%3E%20says%20that%20it%20%2Awasn%27t%2A%20heard%20all%20the%20way%20to%20minas%20tirith%20rather%0A%3E%3E%20that%20he%20had%20a%20presentiment%20of%20doom%20when%20he%20thought%20he%20%27heard%27%20%28and%0A%3E%3E%20one%20which%20later%20came%20to%20be%20fulfilled%29.%0A%3E%0A%3E%20i%27d%20agree%20with%20that%20view%20of%20what%20the%20texts%20say%2C%20but%20would%20argue%20that%0A%3E%20it%20constitutes%20evidence%20of%20human%20magic%20in%20and%20of%20itself.%20why%20did%0A%3E%20faramir%20have%20this%20%27presentiment%20of%20doom%27%3F%20why%20did%20the%20%27echo%20in%20his%0A%3E%20mind%27%20coincide%20with%20the%20time%20boromir%20was%20blowing%20the%20horn%3F%20at%20that%2C%0A%3E%20how%20to%20explain%20%27foresight%27%20amongst%20men%20in%20general%3F%20there%20are%0A%3E%20numerous%20examples%20of%20accurate%20predictions%20of%20the%20future...%20how%20can%0A%3E%20they%20do%20this%20if%20%27magic%27%20is%20completely%20alien%20to%20them%3F%20what%20was%20that%0Awhole%20scene%0A%3E%20with%20gandalf%20and%20denethor%20seeming%20to%20%27match%20wills%27%20really%20about%20if%0A%3E%20denethor%20had%20no%20means%20of%20externalizing%20his%20will%3F%20the%20%27healing%20hands%27%0A%3E%20of%20the%20kings%3F%20the%20wonders%20created%20by%20the%20numenoreans%3F%20references%20to%0A%3E%20human%20sorcerors%3F%0Ahave%20i
coyotes%20rand%20mair%20fheal%20greykitten%20tomys%20des%20anges%20%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote:%0A:%3E%20They%20clearly%20do%20have%20a%20will%20of%20their%20own%20as%20some%20chose%20to%20rebel.%0A%0A:%20did%20they%3F%0A:%20thats%20not%20part%20of%20universal%20canon%0A%0AWhat%20universal%20canon%20are%20you%20referring%20to%3F%20%20It%20is%20part%20of%0Amost%20Christian%20canon.%20%20The%20fallen%20angels%20are%20all%20the%20angels%0Awho%20rebelled%20against%20God.%0A%0AStephen%0A%0A%0A
coyotes%20rand%20mair%20fheal%20greykitten%20tomys%20des%20anges%20in%0A%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20scripsit:%0A%0AThere%20is%20no%20universal%20canon%20among%20all%20Christians%20that%20I%20know%0Aof.%20Catholics%20and%20Orthodoxs%20use%20the%20Septuagint%20canon%2C%20whereas%0AProtestants%20use%20the%20Massoretic%20canon%20%28which%20is%20the%20Jewish%20canon%2C%0ATanakh%29%20plus%20the%20New%20Testament.%20The%20Septuagint%20Bible%20is%20the%20the%0AMassoretic%20canon%20plus%20NT%2C%20plus%20apocryphal%2Fdeuterocanonic%20books%2C%20such%0Aas%20the%20books%20of%20Judith%2C%20Tobit%2C%20Baruch%2C%20Maccabees%201%20and%202%2C%20etc.%0A%0A--%0AMarie-Lan%20Nguyen%0A+++%20Divide%20By%20Cucumber%20Error.%20Please%20Reinstall%20Universe%20And%20Reboot%20+++%0A%28Terry%20Pratchett%2C%20Hogfather%29%0A%3Chttp:%2F%2Fwww.pip-pip.org%2F%3E%0A%0A%0A
coyotes%20rand%20mair%20fheal%20greykitten%20tomys%20des%20anges%20writes:%0A%0A%0A%22What%20then%20would%20you%20have%2C%22%20said%20Gandalf%2C%20%22if%20your%20will%20could%20have%20its%20way%3F%22%0A%0A%22I%20would%20have%20things%20as%20they%20were%20in%20all%20the%20days%20of%20my%20life%2C%22%20answered%0ADenethor%2C%20%22and%20in%20the%20days%20of%20my%20long-fathers%20before%20me:%20to%20be%20the%20Lord%20of%20this%0ACity%20in%20peace%2C%20and%20leave%20my%20chair%20to%20a%20son%20after%20me%2C%20and%20to%20preserve%20the%20purity%0Aof%20essence%20of%20our%20precious%20bodily%20fluids.%20%20But%20if%20doom%20denies%20this%20to%20me%2C%20then%0AI%20will%20have%20naught%20.%20.%20.%20.%22%0A--%0AJohnny%20Pez%0ANewport%2C%20Rhode%20Island%0AJuly%202003%0A%0A%0A
