coyotes%20rand%20mair%20fheal%20greykitten%20tomys%20des%20anges%20wrote:%0AI%27ve%20always%20found%20that%20potential%20part%20of%20the%20history%20of%20the%20Rings%20rather%0Ahard%20to%20swallow:%20it%20sounds%20more%20like%20a%20justification%20on%20the%20part%20of%20the%0ADwarves%20for%20their%20possessing%20%2Aall%2A%20the%20Rings%20-%20if%20they%20can%20claim%20that%0Athey%20came%20by%20%2Aone%2A%20of%20the%20Rings%20honestly%2C%20then%20it%20makes%20it%20easier%20to%0Aclaim%20the%20others.%20Think%20of%20Charlemagne%20getting%20the%20Pope%20to%20crown%20him%0AHoly%20Roman%20Emperor:%20it%20%27legitimised%27%20his%20empire%20building.%0A%0A%0ATrue.%0A%0AJamie%0A%0A--%0A%22The%20more%20I%20see%20of%20the%20world%2C%20the%20more%20am%20I%20dissatisfied%20with%20it%3B%20and%0Aevery%20day%20confirms%20my%20belief%20of%20the%20inconsistency%20of%20all%20human%0Acharacters%2C%20and%20of%20the%20little%20dependence%20that%20can%20be%20placed%20on%20the%0Aappearance%20of%20either%20merit%20or%20sense.%22%0A%0AJane%20Austen%2C%20Pride%20and%20Prejudice%0A%0A%0A%0A
