in%20article%20%3C833qa.2576%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20in%0Arec.arts.books.tolkien%2C%20a%20tsar%20is%20born%0A%41nospam@nospam.net%3E%20wrote%3A%0Ayes%2C%20of%20course.%20there%20have%20been%20many%20good%20novels%20with%20good%20%28or%20even%0Abetter%29%20sequels.%20look%20at%20robert%20b.%20parker%27s%20%22spenser%22%20novels%2C%20now%0Anumbering%20in%20the%20dozens.%20the%20first%20dozen%20or%20so%20have%20been%20quite%20good.%0Alook%20at%20wodehouse.%0Agranted%2C%20it%27s%20also%20easy%20to%20find%20examples%20the%20other%20way%2C%20where%20the%0Asequels%20quickly%20ran%20downhill.%20j.k%20rowling%20comes%20immediately%20to%20mind.%0Athe%20second%20harry%20potter%20was%20so%20much%20inferior%20to%20the%20first%20that%20i%0Afelt%20no%20desire%20to%20read%20any%20of%20the%20later%20ones.%0A--%0Astan%20brown%2C%20oak%20road%20systems%2C%20cortland%20county%2C%20new%20york%2C%20usa%0Ahttp%3A%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%0Atolkien%20faqs%3A%20http%3A%2F%2Ftolkien.slimy.com%20%28steuard%20jensen%27s%20site%29%0Atolkien%20letters%20faq%3A%0Ahttp%3A%2F%2Fusers.telerama.com%2F~taliesen%2Ftolkien%2Flettersfaq.html%0Afaq%20of%20the%20rings%3A%20http%3A%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Fgenl%2Fringfaq.htm%0Aencyclopedia%20of%20arda%3A%20http%3A%2F%2Fwww.glyphweb.com%2Farda%2Fdefault.htm%0Amore%20faqs%3A%20http%3A%2F%2Foakroadsystems.com%2Ftech%2Ffaqget.htm%0A
